#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.title"
msgstr "He whakahoutanga mana pupuri e tika ana mō te haumarutanga ā-motu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.tldr"
msgstr "TL;DR: Kua whakangungua ngā LLM Hainamana (tae atu ki a DeepSeek) i runga i taku putunga pukapuka me ngā pepa turekore — te mea nui rawa atu o te ao. Me whakahou te Hau-ā-uru i te ture mana pupuri hei take mō te haumarutanga ā-motu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.subtitle"
msgstr "ngā tuhinga hoa nā TorrentFreak: <a %(torrentfreak)s>tuatahi</a>, <a %(torrentfreak_2)s>tuarua</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text1"
msgstr "I te wā kāore i roa kua hipa, i te mate haere ngā “whare pukapuka atarangi”. Kua mutu te tango a Sci-Hub, te putunga turekore nui o ngā pepa mātauranga, i ngā mahi hou, nā ngā whakawa. Ko “Z-Library”, te whare pukapuka turekore nui rawa atu o ngā pukapuka, i kite i ōna kaihanga i whakapaetia kua mauheretia mō ngā whakapae mana pupuri hara. Heoi anō, i taea e rātou te mawhiti i te mauheretanga, engari kei te mōrearea tonu tō rātou whare pukapuka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text2"
msgstr "I te wā i tūpono ai te katinga o Z-Library, kua tāruatia katoatia e au tōna whare pukapuka, ā, i te rapu ahau i tētahi tūāpapa hei whakanoho i a ia. Koinei taku hihiri ki te tīmata i te Pūranga a Anna: he whakahaerenga tonu o te kaupapa i muri i aua kaupapa o mua. Kua tipu mātou hei whare pukapuka atarangi nui rawa atu o te ao, e pupuri ana i te neke atu i te 140 miriona tuhinga mana pupuri puta noa i ngā momo hōputu — ngā pukapuka, ngā pepa mātauranga, ngā maheni, ngā nūpepa, me tua atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text3"
msgstr "He tangata whakapono mātou ko taku rōpū. E whakapono ana mātou he tika ā-morare te tiaki me te pupuri i ēnei kōnae. Kei te kite ngā whare pukapuka huri noa i te ao i ngā whakaiti pūtea, ā, kāore hoki e taea te whakawhirinaki ki ngā kamupene mō te taonga tuku iho a te tangata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text4"
msgstr "Ka tae mai te AI. Tata ki ngā kamupene nui katoa e hanga ana i ngā LLM i whakapā mai ki a mātou ki te whakangungu i runga i ā mātou raraunga. Ko te nuinga (engari kāore katoa!) o ngā kamupene nō Amerika i whakaaro anō i te wā i mōhio ai rātou ki te āhua turekore o ā mātou mahi. Engari, kua kaha te whakaae a ngā kamupene Hainamana ki tā mātou kohinga, kāore i te āwangawanga ki tōna āhua ture. He mea nui tēnei i te mea ko Haina he hainatanga ki te nuinga o ngā tiriti mana pupuri ā-ao."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text5"
msgstr "Kua tukuna e mātou te uru tere ki te tata ki te 30 kamupene. Ko te nuinga he kamupene LLM, ā, ko ētahi he kaihokohoko raraunga, ka hokona anō ā mātou kohinga. Ko te nuinga he Hainamana, ahakoa kua mahi tahi hoki mātou me ngā kamupene nō Amerika, Ūropi, Rūhia, Korea ki te Tonga, me Hapani. I <a %(arxiv)s>whakaae</a> a DeepSeek i whakangungua tētahi putanga o mua i runga i tētahi wāhanga o ā mātou kohinga, ahakoa he ngū rātou mō tā rātou tauira hou (pea i whakangungua hoki i runga i ā mātou raraunga)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text6"
msgstr "Ki te hiahia te Hau-ā-uru ki te noho ki mua i te whakataetae o ngā LLM, ā, i te mutunga, AGI, me whakaaro anō ki tōna tūranga mō te mana pupuri, ā, me hohoro. Ahakoa e whakaae ana koe ki a mātou, kāore rānei i runga i tō mātou take ā-morare, kei te huri tēnei hei take ōhanga, ā, tae noa ki te haumarutanga ā-motu. Kei te hanga ngā poraka mana katoa i ngā pūtaiao hangarau, ngā pūmanawa hangarau, me ngā ope taua hangarau. Kei te huri te herekore o te mōhiohio hei take mō te oranga mō ēnei whenua — tae noa ki te haumarutanga ā-motu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text7"
msgstr "Nō ngā tōpito katoa o te ao tō mātou rōpū, ā, kāore mātou i te whai i tētahi whakaritenga motuhake. Engari ka akiaki mātou i ngā whenua me ngā ture mana pupuri kaha ki te whakamahi i tēnei mōrearea ki te whakahou i a rātou. Nā reira, me aha?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text8"
msgstr "Ko tā mātou tūtohutanga tuatahi he māmā: whakaitihia te wā mana pupuri. I Amerika, ka whakawhiwhia te mana pupuri mō te 70 tau i muri i te matenga o te kaituhi. He rorirori tēnei. Ka taea e mātou te whakatika i tēnei ki ngā patent, ka whakawhiwhia mō te 20 tau i muri i te tuku. Me nui ake tēnei wā mō ngā kaituhi o ngā pukapuka, ngā pepa, te puoro, te toi, me ētahi atu mahi auaha, kia whiwhi utu katoa mō ā rātou mahi (tae atu ki ngā kaupapa wā roa pērā i ngā urutaunga kiriata)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text9"
msgstr "Nā, i te iti rawa, me whakauru e ngā kaihanga kaupapa here he wāhi motuhake mō te tiaki me te tohatoha nui o ngā tuhinga. Mēnā ko te ngaro o te moni whiwhi mai i ngā kiritaki takitahi te āwangawanga matua, ka taea tonu te aukati i te tohatoha taumata whaiaro. Hei utu, ko te hunga e taea ana te whakahaere i ngā putunga nui — ngā kamupene e whakangungu ana i ngā LLM, me ngā whare pukapuka me ētahi atu pūranga — ka kapi i ēnei whakatārewa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text10"
msgstr "Kei te mahi kē ētahi whenua i tētahi putanga o tēnei. I <a %(torrentfreak)s>pūrongo</a> a TorrentFreak kua whakaurua e Haina me Hapani ngā whakatārewa AI ki ā rātou ture mana pupuri. Kāore i te mārama ki a mātou me pēhea te pānga o tēnei ki ngā tiriti ā-ao, engari e tino tuku ana i te uhi ki ā rātou kamupene ā-rohe, e whakamārama ana i ngā mea kua kite mātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.text11"
msgstr "Mō te Pūranga a Anna — ka haere tonu mātou i ā mātou mahi huna i runga i te whakapono ā-morare. Heoi, ko tā mātou tino hiahia ko te kuhu ki te ao mārama, ā, kia whakanuia ā mātou pānga i runga i te ture. Tēnā, whakahoungia te mana pupuri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.ai-copyright.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
