#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text5"
msgstr "Tirohia te <a %(all_isbns)s>pou rangitaki taketake</a> mō ētahi atu pārongo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winner.text6"
msgstr "I tukuna e mātou he wero kia pai ake ai tēnei. Ka whakawhiwhia e mātou he utu tuatahi o te $6,000, te tuarua o te $3,000, me te tuatoru o te $1,000. Nā te nui o te urupare me ngā tukunga whakamīharo, kua whakatau mātou ki te whakapiki i te pūtea taonga, ā, ka whakawhiwhia e mātou he whā-ara tuatoru o te $500 ia tangata. Kei raro nei ngā toa, engari kia mātua tirohia ngā tukunga katoa <a %(annas_archive)s>i konei</a>, me te tikiake i tā mātou <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>torrent whakakotahi</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first"
msgstr "Te tuatahi $6,000: phiresky"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.first.text1"
msgstr "Ko tēnei <a %(phiresky_github)s>tukunga</a> (<a %(annas_archive_note_2951)s>kōrero Gitlab</a>) he tino katoa i hiahia ai mātou, ā, he nui ake! I tino pai ki a mātou ngā kōwhiringa whakairoiro tino ngāwari (ahakoa te tautoko i ngā shaders ritenga), engari me te rārangi whānui o ngā tautuhinga. I pai hoki ki a mātou te tere me te maeneene o ngā mea katoa, te whakatinanatanga māmā (kāore he backend), te mahere iti atamai, me te whakamārama whānui i tā rātou <a %(phiresky_github)s>pou rangitaki</a>. He mahi whakamīharo, ā, he toa tika!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second"
msgstr "Te tuarua $3,000: hypha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text1"
msgstr "He <a %(annas_archive_note_2913)s>tukunga</a> whakamīharo anō. Kāore i te ngāwari pērā i te tuatahi, engari i pai ake ki a mātou tana whakairoiro taumata-macro i te tuatahi (kōpiko whakakī mokowā, taitapa, tapanga, miramira, paneke, me te topa). He <a %(annas_archive_note_2971)s>kōrero</a> nā Joe Davis i pā ki a mātou:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.quote"
msgstr "“Ahakoa he pai te āhua o ngā tapawhā me ngā tapawhā roa i te pāngarau, kāore e pai ake te noho tata i te horopaki mahere. E whakapono ana ahau ko te koretake i roto i ēnei Hilbert, Morton tawhito rānei, ehara i te hapa engari he āhuatanga. Pērā i te āhua o Itari e mōhiotia ana i runga i te mahere, ko ngā \"āhuatanga\" ahurei o ēnei kōpiko ka noho hei tohu hinengaro. Ka taea e tēnei ahurei te whakapai ake i te mahara mokowā me te āwhina i ngā kaiwhakamahi ki te whakatere i a rātou, ka taea pea te kimi i ngā rohe motuhake, te kite rānei i ngā tauira.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.second.text2"
msgstr "Ā, he maha tonu ngā kōwhiringa mō te whakairoiro me te whakaatu, me te atanga kaiwhakamahi tino maeneene me te māmā. He tuarua pakari!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1"
msgstr "Te tuatoru $500 #1: maxlion"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third1.text1"
msgstr "I roto i tēnei <a %(annas_archive_note_2940)s>tukunga</a> i tino pai ki a mātou ngā momo tirohanga rerekē, otirā ko ngā tirohanga whakataurite me te kaiwhakaputa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2"
msgstr "Te tuatoru $500 #2: abetusk"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third2.text1"
msgstr "Ahakoa kāore i tino oti te atanga kaiwhakamahi, he maha ngā pouaka i tirohia e tēnei <a %(annas_archive_note_2917)s>tukunga</a>. I tino pai ki a mātou tana āhuatanga whakataurite."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3"
msgstr "Te tuatoru $500 #3: conundrumer0"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third3.text1"
msgstr "Pērā i te tuatahi, i whakamīharo tēnei <a %(annas_archive_note_2975)s>tukunga</a> i a mātou ki tōna ngāwari. Ko te mutunga, koinei te mea e pai ai te taputapu whakairoiro: te tino ngāwari mō ngā kaiwhakamahi kaha, i te wa e māmā ana mō ngā kaiwhakamahi toharite."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4"
msgstr "Te tuatoru $500 #4: charelf"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.third4.text1"
msgstr "Ko te <a %(annas_archive_note_2947)s>tukunga</a> whakamutunga ki te whiwhi utu he tino taketake, engari he āhuatanga ahurei i tino pai ki a mātou. I pai ki a mātou te whakaatu i te maha o ngā datasets e kapi ana i tētahi ISBN motuhake hei ine i te rongonui/pono. I tino pai hoki ki a mātou te māmā engari te whai hua o te whakamahi i te rēreti pūataata mō ngā whakataurite."

