#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text2"
msgstr "Ka taea tonu te haere tonu mō te wā roa, engari me mutu i konei. Kia mātua tirohia ngā tukunga katoa <a %(annas_archive)s>i konei</a>, ā, tikiake rānei i tā mātou <a %(a_2025_01_isbn_visualization_files)s>tōrere whakakotahi</a>. He maha ngā tukunga, ā, he tirohanga ahurei ia, ahakoa i te UI, i te whakatinanatanga rānei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.notable.text3"
