#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.title"
msgstr "Te Whakaatu i Ngā ISBN Katoa — $10,000 utu mō te 2025-01-31"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.tldr"
msgstr "Ko tēnei pikitia te rārangi pukapuka tino tuwhera rawa atu kua whakahiatohia i roto i te hītori o te tangata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text1"
msgstr "Ko tēnei pikitia he 1000×800 pika. Ia pika e tohu ana i te 2,500 ISBN. Mēnā he kōnae tā mātou mō tētahi ISBN, ka whakakākāriki mātou i taua pika. Mēnā e mōhio ana mātou kua tukuna tētahi ISBN, engari kāore he kōnae e hāngai ana, ka whakakākariki mātou i te pika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text2"
msgstr "I roto i te iti iho i te 300kb, ka whakaatu tēnei pikitia i te rārangi pukapuka tino tuwhera rawa atu kua whakahiatohia i roto i te hītori o te tangata (he rau rau GB kua kōpeke katoa)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.text3"
msgstr "E whakaatu ana hoki: he nui tonu te mahi hei tautoko i ngā pukapuka (16% anake tā mātou)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background"
msgstr "Papamuri"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text1"
msgstr "Me pēhea e taea ai e te Pūranga a Anna te whakatutuki i tana misioni ki te tārua i ngā mōhiotanga katoa o te tangata, me te kore e mōhio ko ēhea pukapuka kei waho tonu? Me whai rārangi TODO mātou. Ko tētahi ara hei mapi i tēnei ko ngā tau ISBN, i te mea mai i te tekau tau atu i 1970 kua tohaina ki ia pukapuka i whakaputaina (i te nuinga o ngā whenua)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text2"
msgstr "Kāore he mana pokapū e mōhio ana ki ngā tohatoha ISBN katoa. Engari, he pūnaha tohatoha, kei reira ngā whenua e whiwhi ana i ngā whānuitanga o ngā tau, ka tohaina e rātou ngā whānuitanga iti ki ngā kaiwhakaputa matua, ka taea pea te wehewehe anō i ngā whānuitanga ki ngā kaiwhakaputa iti. Ka mutu, ka tohaina ngā tau takitahi ki ngā pukapuka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text3"
msgstr "I tīmata mātou ki te mapi i ngā ISBN <a %(blog)s>e rua tau ki muri</a> me tā mātou keri i te ISBNdb. Mai i taua wā, kua keri mātou i ngā puna metadata maha atu, pērā i <a %(blog_2)s>Worldcat</a>, Google Books, Goodreads, Libby, me ētahi atu. Ka kitea te rārangi katoa i ngā whārangi “Datasets” me “Torrents” i te Pūranga a Anna. Ināianei, kei a mātou te kohinga metadata pukapuka tino nui rawa atu, ka taea te tiki noa, i te ao."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.background.text4"
msgstr "Kua <a %(blog)s>tuhi whānui</a> mātou mō te take e aro ana mātou ki te tiaki, me te take kei roto mātou i tētahi matapihi tino hira i tēnei wā. Me tautuhi ināianei i ngā pukapuka onge, kāore i te arohia, me ngā pukapuka e tino mōrearea ana, ā, me tiaki. Ko te whai i ngā metadata pai mō ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao ka āwhina i tēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing"
msgstr "Whakaaturanga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text1"
msgstr "I tua atu i te whakaahua tirohanga whānui, ka taea hoki te titiro ki ngā datasets takitahi kua riro mai i a mātou. Whakamahia te taka-iho me ngā pātene hei whakawhiti i waenga i a rātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.visualizing.text2"
msgstr "He maha ngā tauira whakamere hei kite i ēnei whakaahua. He aha te take he ōritetanga o ngā rārangi me ngā poraka, e kitea ana i ngā tauine rerekē? He aha ngā wāhi pātea? He aha te take he tino piri ngā datasets ētahi? Ka waiho ēnei pātai hei mahi mā te kaipānui."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty"
msgstr "$10,000 utu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text1"
msgstr "He nui ngā mea hei tūhura i konei, nā reira ka pānuitia e mātou he utu mō te whakapai ake i te whakaaturanga i runga ake nei. Kāore i rite ki te nuinga o ā mātou utu, he here wā tēnei. Me <a %(annas_archive)s>tuku</a> tō waehere puna tuwhera i mua i te 2025-01-31 (23:59 UTC)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text2"
msgstr "Ko te tuku pai rawa atu ka whiwhi $6,000, ko te tuarua $3,000, ā, ko te tuatoru $1,000. Ka whakawhiwhia ngā utu katoa mā te Monero (XMR)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.text3"
msgstr "Kei raro nei ngā paearu iti rawa. Mēnā kāore he tuku e tutuki ana i ngā paearu, tērā pea ka whakawhiwhia tonu ētahi utu, engari mā mātou e whakatau."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req1"
msgstr "Tuhia tēnei repo, ā, whakatika i tēnei tuhinga HTML (kāore e whakaaetia ētahi atu tūmau i tua atu i tā mātou tūmau Flask)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req2"
msgstr "Me māmā te whakaahua i runga ake nei ki te topa, kia taea ai te topa ki ngā ISBN takitahi. Ko te pāwhiri i ngā ISBN me kawe koe ki tētahi whārangi metadata, rapu rānei i te Pūranga a Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req3"
msgstr "Me taea tonu te whakawhiti i waenga i ngā datasets rerekē katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req4"
msgstr "Me miramira ngā whānuitanga whenua me ngā whānuitanga kaiwhakaputa i te pāwhiri. Ka taea e koe te whakamahi hei tauira <a %(github_xlcnd_isbnlib)s>data4info.py i te isbnlib</a> mō ngā pārongo whenua, me tā mātou keri “isbngrp” mō ngā kaiwhakaputa (<a %(annas_archive)s>dataset</a>, <a %(annas_archive_2)s>torrent</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns.bounty.req5"
msgstr "Me pai te mahi i runga i te papamahi me te pūkoro."

