#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal1"
msgstr "Kāore mātou e aro ki te māmā o te whakatere ā-ringa i ngā kōnae i runga i te kōpae, te rapu rānei me te kore e whakatūpato."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal2"
