#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.nongoal3"
msgstr "Ahakoa me māmā te whakatō i ā mātou kohinga mā te whakamahi i ngā torohū, kāore mātou e tūmanako ka taea te whakamahi i ngā kōnae me te kore e nui te mōhiotanga hangarau me te ū."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.goals.text3"
msgstr "I te mea he puna tuwhera Te Pātaka o Anna, e hiahia ana mātou ki te whakamahi i tā mātou hōputu. Ina whakahou mātou i tā mātou rārangi rapu, ka uru noa mātou ki ngā ara e wātea ana ki te marea, kia tere ai te tīmata a te hunga e kape ana i tā mātou whare pukapuka."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.heading"
msgstr "Te paerewa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.text1"
msgstr "I te mutunga, i whakatauhia e mātou he paerewa māmā noa iho. He āhua māmā, kāore i te whakatauira, ā, he mahi e haere tonu ana."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aac"
msgstr "<strong>AAC.</strong> Ko te AAC (Anna’s Archive Container) he tūemi kotahi e whai ana i te <strong>metadata</strong>, ā, he kōwhiringa te <strong>raraunga ā-ira</strong>, e rua nei ngā mea kāore e taea te whakarerekē. He tohu ahurei ā-ao tōna, e kīia nei ko <strong>AACID</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.collection"
msgstr "<strong>Kohinga.</strong> Kei roto ia AAC i tētahi kohinga, ā, mā te whakamāramatanga he rārangi o ngā AAC e hāngai ana ki te tikanga. Ko te tikanga, mēnā ka whakarerekē nui koe i te hōputu o te metadata, me hanga e koe he kohinga hou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.records-files"
msgstr "<strong>“kōnae” me ngā kohinga “kōrero”.</strong> Mā te tikanga, he pai tonu te tuku i ngā “kōnae” me ngā “kōrero” hei kohinga rerekē, kia taea ai te tuku i ngā wā rerekē, hei tauira, i runga i ngā reiti keri raraunga. Ko te “kōrero” he kohinga metadata anake, kei roto ngā mōhiohio pērā i ngā taitara pukapuka, ngā kaituhi, ISBN, aha atu, ko ngā “kōnae” ko ngā kohinga kei roto ngā kōnae tūturu (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Ko te hōputu o te AACID ko tēnei: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Hei tauira, ko tētahi AACID tūturu kua tukuna e mātou ko <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: te ingoa kohinga, ka taea te whai reta ASCII, tau, me ngā piko (engari kāore he piko rua)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: he putanga poto o te ISO 8601, i ngā wā katoa i UTC, hei tauira <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Me piki haere tēnei tau mō ia tukunga, ahakoa ka rerekē pea ōna tikanga tūturu mō ia kohinga. Ka tūtohu mātou ki te whakamahi i te wā o te keri raraunga, o te hanga rānei i te ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: he tautuhi motuhake mō te kohinga, mēnā e hāngai ana, hei tauira ko te ID Z-Library. Ka taea te whakakore, te whakapototia rānei. Me whakakore, me whakapototia rānei mēnā ka nui ake te AACID i te 150 pūāhua."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: he UUID engari kua kōpeke ki te ASCII, hei tauira mā te whakamahi i te base57. I tēnei wā, kei te whakamahi mātou i te <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> Python library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Awhe AACID.</strong> Nā te mea kei roto i ngā AACID ngā wāhanga wā e piki haere ana, ka taea e mātou te whakamahi i tērā hei tohu i ngā awhe i roto i tētahi kohinga motuhake. Ka whakamahi mātou i tēnei hōputu: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, kei reira ngā wāhanga wā e kapi ana. He rite tēnei ki te tuhinga ISO 8601. He tōtika ngā awhe, ā, ka taea te tāpiri, engari mēnā ka tāpiri me whai i ngā rekoata ōrite ki te mea i tukuna i mua i taua kohinga (nā te mea kāore e taea te whakarerekē ngā AAC). Kāore e whakaaetia ngā rekoata ngaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Kōnae metadata.</strong> Kei roto i te kōnae metadata ngā metadata o tētahi awhe o ngā AAC, mō tētahi kohinga motuhake. Kei a rātou ēnei āhuatanga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Me tīmata te ingoa kōnae ki tētahi awhe AACID, ka whai i te <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> ka whai i te <code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Hei tauira, ko tētahi o ā mātou tukunga e kīia ana<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "E ai ki te toronga kōnae, ko te momo kōnae he <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> kua kōpeke ki te <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Me whai ia ahanoa JSON i ngā mara e whai ake nei i te taumata runga: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (kōwhiringa). Kāore e whakaaetia ētahi atu mara."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> he metadata noa iho, e ai ki ngā tikanga o te kohinga. Me hāngai ki te tikanga i roto i te kohinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> he kōwhiringa, ā, ko te ingoa o te kōpaki raraunga ā-ira e mau ana i te raraunga ā-ira e hāngai ana. Ko te ingoa kōnae o te raraunga ā-ira e hāngai ana i roto i taua kōpaki ko te AACID o te rekoata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Ka taea te urutau i te kupu whakataki <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> ki te ingoa o tō whare wānanga, hei tauira <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Kōpaki raraunga ā-ira.</strong> He kōpaki me ngā raraunga ā-ira o tētahi awhe o ngā AAC, mō tētahi kohinga motuhake. Kei a rātou ēnei āhuatanga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Me tīmata te ingoa kōpaki ki tētahi awhe AACID, ka whai i te <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, ā, kāore he tūtohu. Hei tauira, ko tētahi o ā mātou tukunga tūturu he kōpaki e kīia ana<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Me whai te kōpaki i ngā kōnae raraunga mō ngā AAC katoa i roto i te awhe kua tohua. Me whai ia kōnae raraunga i tōna AACID hei ingoa kōnae (kāore he toronga)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "E taunaki ana kia hanga ēnei kōpaki kia āhua māmā te whakahaere, hei tauira, kaua e nui ake i te 100GB-1TB ia kōpaki, ahakoa ka taea te huri i tēnei taunakitanga i te roanga o te wā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Ka taea te whakakotahi i ngā kōnae metadata me ngā kōpaki raraunga taupua ki roto i ngā torrents, kotahi te torrent mō ia kōnae metadata, kotahi rānei te torrent mō ia kōpaki raraunga taupua. Me whai te ingoa kōnae taketake me te <code>.torrent</code> hei tōpene kōnae mō ngā torrents."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Tauira"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "Me titiro tātou ki tā mātou tukunga Z-Library hou hei tauira. E rua ngā kohinga kei roto: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” me “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Mā tēnei ka taea e mātou te keri me te tuku wehe i ngā rekoata metadata mai i ngā kōnae pukapuka tūturu. Nā reira, i tukuna e mātou e rua ngā torrents me ngā kōnae metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "I tukuna hoki e mātou he rōpū o ngā torrents me ngā kōpaki raraunga taupua, engari mō te kohinga “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>” anake, 62 katoa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Mā te whakahaere i te <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> ka kite tātou he aha kei roto:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "I tēnei wā, he metadata o tētahi pukapuka e ai ki te pūrongo a Z-Library. I te taumata-runga kei a mātou anake te “aacid” me te “metadata”, engari kāore he “data_folder”, nā te mea kāore he raraunga taupua e hāngai ana. Kei roto i te AACID te “22430000” hei ID matua, ka kite tātou i tangohia mai i te “zlibrary_id”. Ka taea te tūmanako ka whai te hanganga kotahi ētahi atu AAC i tēnei kohinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Inaianei me whakahaere te <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "He iti noa iho tēnei metadata AAC, ahakoa kei wāhi kē te nuinga o tēnei AAC i roto i tētahi kōnae taupua! I te mutunga, kei a mātou he “data_folder” i tēnei wā, nā reira ka taea te tūmanako kei te wāhi <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code> te raraunga taupua e hāngai ana. Kei roto i te “metadata” te “zlibrary_id”, nā reira ka taea te hono māmā ki te AAC e hāngai ana i te kohinga “zlib_records”. Ka taea te hono i roto i ngā huarahi rerekē, hei tauira mā te AACID — kāore te paerewa e whakahau i tērā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Me mōhio hoki kāore e tika ana kia JSON anake te mara “metadata”. Ka taea te waiho hei aho kei roto ko te XML, ko tētahi atu hōputu raraunga rānei. Ka taea anō te penapena i ngā mōhiohio metadata i roto i te taupua e hāngai ana, hei tauira mēnā he nui te raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Whakamutunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Mā tēnei paerewa, ka taea e mātou te tuku i ngā tukunga i te āhua o te wā, me te tāpiri māmā i ngā puna raraunga hou. Kua whai kē mātou i ētahi tukunga whakahihiri kei te ara!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "E tūmanako ana hoki mātou ka māmā ake mō ētahi atu whare pukapuka atarangi te whakaata i ā mātou kohinga. I te mutunga, ko tā mātou whāinga he tiaki i te mātauranga me te ahurea tangata mō ake tonu atu, nā reira ko te nui o te tāruatanga, ko te pai ake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Te Whakahou a Anna: he pūranga tuwhera katoa, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ o ngā uhi pukapuka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Kua mahi mātou i te pō, i te ao ki te tuku i tētahi kōwhiringa pai me te Pūranga a Anna. Anei ētahi o ngā mea i tutuki i a mātou inā tata nei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "I te hekenga o te Z-Library me te hopukanga o ōna (e whakapaetia ana) kaihanga, kua mahi mātou i te pō, i te ao ki te tuku i tētahi kōwhiringa pai me te Pūranga a Anna (kāore mātou e hono atu ki konei, engari ka taea e koe te rapu i a Google). Anei ētahi o ngā mea i tutuki i a mātou inā tata nei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "He tuwhera katoa te Pūranga a Anna"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "E whakapono ana mātou me wātea te mōhiohio, ā, kāore he rerekētanga o tā mātou ake waehere. Kua tukuna katoatia e mātou ā mātou waehere i runga i tā mātou ake Gitlab tūmau: <a %(annas_archive)s>Pūmanawa a Anna</a>. Ka whakamahia hoki e mātou te aroturuki take hei whakarite i ā mātou mahi. Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te whai wāhi ki tā mātou whanaketanga, he wāhi pai tēnei hei tīmata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Hei whakaatu i ētahi o ngā mea e mahi ana mātou, tirohia tā mātou mahi hou i runga i ngā whakapainga mahi a te kiritaki. I te mea kāore anō mātou kia whakatinana i te whārangi whārangi, he maha ngā whārangi rapu roa ka whakahokia e mātou, me ngā hua 100-200. Kāore mātou i hiahia ki te tapahi wawe i ngā hua rapu, engari i te mutunga ka pōturi ētahi taputapu. Mō tēnei, i whakatinana mātou i tētahi tinihanga iti: i takai mātou i te nuinga o ngā hua rapu ki roto i ngā kōrero HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), ā, kātahi ka tuhi mātou i tētahi Javascript iti hei kite i te wā e tika ana kia kitea tētahi hua, i taua wā ka wetewete mātou i te kōrero:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "Kua whakatinanahia te \"virtualization\" DOM i roto i te 23 rārangi, kāore he hiahia mō ngā whare pukapuka huatau! Koinei te momo waehere whaihua tere ka puta i a koe ina he iti te wā, ā, he raru tūturu e hiahia ana kia whakatauria. Kua pūrongotia kei te pai te mahi a tā mātou rapu i runga i ngā pūrere pōturi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Ko tētahi atu mahi nui ko te aunoa i te hanga i te pātengi raraunga. I te wā i whakarewahia ai mātou, i kohikohi noa mātou i ngā puna rerekē. Ināianei e hiahia ana mātou ki te pupuri i a rātou kia whakahoutia, nā reira i tuhia e mātou he huinga o ngā tuhinga hei tikiake i ngā metadata hou mai i ngā peka e rua o Library Genesis, ā, ka whakauru i a rātou. Ko te whāinga kia kaua e whai hua noa mō tā mātou pūranga, engari kia māmā hoki te mahi mā te hunga e hiahia ana ki te tākaro ki ngā metadata whare pukapuka atarangi. Ko te whāinga ko tētahi pukapuka Jupyter kei reira ngā momo metadata whakamere katoa e wātea ana, kia taea ai e mātou te rangahau atu anō pēnei i te kimi i te <a %(blog)s>ōrau o ngā ISBN e tiakina ana mō ake tonu atu</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Hei te mutunga, kua whakahouhia e mātou tā mātou pūnaha takoha. Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i tētahi kāri nama ki te tuku moni tika ki roto i ā mātou pūkoro crypto, me te kore e tino mōhio ki ngā moni crypto. Ka haere tonu mātou ki te aroturuki i te pai o tēnei mahi i roto i te mahi, engari he mea nui tēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Huri ki ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "Ko tētahi o ā mātou <a %(annas_archive)s>tikiti</a> he kohinga o ngā take me tā mātou pūnaha rapu. I whakamahia e mātou te rapu kuputuhi katoa a MySQL, i te mea kei roto katoa ā mātou raraunga i MySQL. Engari he here tōna:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Ko ētahi pātai i roa rawa te wā, ki te wāhi ka noho rātou i ngā hononga tuwhera katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Ko te tikanga he roa rawa te roa o te kupu iti rawa a MySQL, ka nui rawa tō tūtohu. I pūrongotia e te tangata kāore e taea te rapu mō “Ben Hur”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "He tere noa iho te rapu i te wā i utaina katoatia ki te mahara, i hiahiatia ai e mātou te tiki i tētahi mīhini utu nui ake hei whakahaere i tēnei, me ētahi whakahau hei uta i te tūtohu i te tīmatanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Kāore e taea e mātou te whakawhānui i te reira kia ngāwari ki te hanga āhuatanga hou, pēnei i te <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>whakawhitinga kupu pai ake mō ngā reo kāore i te wāhi</a>, te tātari/te whakatakoto, te whakaraupapa, ngā tūtohutanga \"i kī koe\", te whakaoti aunoa, me ērā atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "I muri i te kōrero ki te tini o ngā tohunga, i whakatauhia e mātou ki ElasticSearch. Kāore i tino pai (he koretake ā rātou tūtohutanga \"i kī koe\" me ngā āhuatanga whakaoti aunoa), engari i te nuinga o te wā he pai ake i te MySQL mō te rapu. Kāore mātou e <a %(youtube)s>tino rata</a> ki te whakamahi i tēnei mō ngā raraunga tino hira (ahakoa kua nui te <a %(elastic_co)s>ahunga whakamua</a> a rātou), engari i te nuinga o te wā he tino harikoa mātou ki te huringa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "I tēnei wā, kua whakatinanahia e mātou te rapu tere ake, te tautoko reo pai ake, te whakaraupapa whaitake pai ake, ngā kōwhiringa whakaraupapa rerekē, me te tātari i runga i te reo/momo pukapuka/momo kōnae. Mēnā kei te pākiki koe me pēhea te mahi, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>titiro</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>ki</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>tēnei</a>. He tino wātea, ahakoa me nui ake ngā kōrero…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ o ngā uhi pukapuka kua tukuna"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Hei te mutunga, e harikoa ana mātou ki te pānui i tētahi tukunga iti. I te mahi tahi me te hunga e whakahaere ana i te peka Libgen.rs, kei te tohatoha mātou i ā rātou uhi pukapuka katoa mā ngā awa me te IPFS. Ka tohatoha tēnei i te kawenga o te mātakitaki i ngā uhi ki waenga i ngā mīhini maha atu, ā, ka pai ake te tiaki i a rātou. I roto i te maha (engari kāore i te katoa) o ngā wā, kei roto i ngā kōnae ake ngā uhi pukapuka, nō reira he momo \"raraunga i ahu mai\". Engari he tino whai hua tonu te whai i roto i te IPFS mō te mahi o ia rā o te Pūpū a Anna me ngā peka rerekē o Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Pērā i te tikanga, ka taea e koe te kimi i tēnei tukunga i te Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kua neke ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Pūpū a Anna</a>). Kāore mātou e hono atu ki konei, engari ka taea e koe te kimi ngāwari."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Ko te tūmanako ka taea e mātou te whakangā i tā mātou tere, ināianei kua whai kē mātou i tētahi kē atu ki Z-Library. Kāore tēnei kawenga mahi i te tino toitū. Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te āwhina i te hōtaka, i ngā mahi tūmau, i te mahi tiaki rānei, me whakapā mai ki a mātou. He nui tonu te <a %(annas_archive)s>mahi hei mahi</a>. Ngā mihi mō tō hiahia me tō tautoko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Kua tāruatia e te Pūpū a Anna te whare pukapuka atarangi pukapuka kōmeke nui rawa o te ao (95TB) — ka taea e koe te āwhina ki te purapura"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Ko te whare pukapuka atarangi pukapuka kōmeke nui rawa o te ao he wāhi kotahi o te ngoikore.. tae noa ki tēnei rā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Kōrerohia i runga i te Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Ko te whare pukapuka atarangi pukapuka kōmeke nui rawa pea ko tētahi o ngā peka o Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Ko te kaiwhakahaere kotahi e whakahaere ana i taua pae i kohikohi i tētahi kohinga kōmeke tino nui o te neke atu i te 2 miriona kōnae, e 95TB te katoa. Heoi, kāore i rite ki ētahi atu kohinga o Library Genesis, kāore tēnei i wātea i te nuinga mā ngā awa. Ka taea anake e koe te uru atu ki ēnei kōmeke takitahi mā tana tūmau whaiaro pōturi — he wāhi kotahi o te ngoikore. Tae noa ki tēnei rā!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "I tēnei pou ka kōrero atu mātou ki a koe mō tēnei kohinga, me tō mātou kohikohi pūtea hei tautoko i tēnei mahi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>E ngana ana a Dr. Barbara Gordon ki te ngaro i a ia anō i te ao noa o te whare pukapuka…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Ngā peka Libgen"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Tuatahi, he kōrero whakamārama. Tērā pea e mōhio ana koe ki a Library Genesis mō tā rātou kohinga pukapuka nui. He iti ake te hunga e mōhio ana kua waihangatia e ngā tūao o Library Genesis ētahi atu kaupapa, pērā i tētahi kohinga nui o ngā maheni me ngā tuhinga paerewa, he tārua katoa o Sci-Hub (i te mahi tahi me te kaiwhakarewa o Sci-Hub, a Alexandra Elbakyan), āe rānei, he kohinga nui o ngā kōmeke."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "I tētahi wā, i wehe kē ngā kaiwhakahaere o ngā whakaata o Library Genesis, ā, nā tēnei i puta ai te āhuatanga o nāianei o te maha o ngā “peka” rerekē, e mau tonu ana te ingoa Library Genesis. Ko te peka Libgen.li anake kei a ia tēnei kohinga kōmeke, me tētahi kohinga maheni nui (e mahi ana hoki mātou ki tēnei)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Mahi tahi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Nā tōna rahi, kua roa tēnei kohinga i runga i tō mātou rārangi hiahia, nō reira i muri i tō mātou angitu ki te tārua i te Z-Library, i aro mātou ki tēnei kohinga. I te tuatahi i keri mātou i a ia, he tino wero tēnei, i te mea kāore i te pai te tūnga o tō rātou tūmau. I whiwhi mātou i te 15TB mā tēnei ara, engari he pōturi te haere."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Waimarie, i taea e mātou te whakapā atu ki te kaiwhakahaere o te whare pukapuka, i whakaae ki te tuku mai i ngā raraunga katoa ki a mātou, he tere ake tēnei. Heoi anō, i pau te haurua tau ki te whakawhiti me te tukatuka i ngā raraunga katoa, ā, tata ngaro katoa i a mātou nā te pirau kōpae, me tīmata anō pea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Nā tēnei wheako i whakapono ai mātou he mea nui kia tere te tuku i ēnei raraunga ki waho, kia taea ai te whakaata whānui. Kotahi, e rua rānei ngā aituā i te wā hē ka ngaro katoa tēnei kohinga mō ake tonu atu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Te kohinga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Ko te tere o te nekehanga e tohu ana he iti te whakariterite o te kohinga… Me titiro tātou. Whakaarohia he pūnaha kōnae tā tātou (e wāwāhia ana e mātou ki ngā toroa):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Ko te kōpaki tuatahi, <code>/repository</code>, ko te wāhanga whakarite ake tēnei. Kei roto i tēnei kōpaki ngā “kōpaki mano” e kīia nei: he kōpaki kei ia kōpaki he mano kōnae, e taupūhia ana i te pātengi raraunga. Kei te kōpaki <code>0</code> ngā kōnae me te comic_id 0–999, ā, pēnei tonu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Ko tēnei te kaupapa e whakamahia ana e Library Genesis mō āna kohinga pakiwaitara me ngā kohinga kore-pakiwaitara. Ko te whakaaro ko ia “kōpaki mano” ka huri aunoa hei toroa i te wā ka kī katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Heoi anō, kāore te kaiwhakahaere o Libgen.li i hanga toroa mō tēnei kohinga, nō reira i raru pea ngā kōpaki mano, ā, i puta mai ngā “kōpaki kāore i whakaritea”. Ko ēnei <code>/comics0</code> tae noa ki <code>/comics4</code>. Kei roto katoa he hanganga kōpaki ahurei, i whai tikanga pea mō te kohikohi i ngā kōnae, engari kāore i te tino whai tikanga ki a mātou ināianei. Waimarie, e hāngai tonu ana te metadata ki ēnei kōnae katoa, nō reira kāore te whakariterite i runga i te kōpae e tino whai tikanga ana!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Kei te wātea te metadata i te puka pātengi raraunga MySQL. Ka taea te tikiake tika mai i te paetukutuku Libgen.li, engari ka tukuna hoki e mātou hei toroa, me tō mātou ripanga ake me ngā hautau MD5 katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Tātari"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Ka whiwhi koe i te 95TB kua tukuna ki tō pūnaha rokiroki, ka ngana koe ki te mārama he aha kei roto… I mahi mātou i tētahi tātari kia kite mēnā ka taea te whakaiti i te rahi, pērā i te tango i ngā tārua. Anei ētahi o ā mātou kitenga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Ka taea te tātari i ngā tārua semantic (ngā kape rerekē o te pukapuka kotahi) i te ariā, engari he uaua. I te titiro ā-ringa ki ngā kōmeke i kitea e mātou he maha rawa ngā hē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "He ētahi tārua mā te MD5 anake, he moumou rawa tēnei, engari mā te tango i ēnei ka whiwhi mātou i te 1% in penapena. I tēnei tauine he 1TB tonu tēnei, engari i tēnei tauine kāore te 1TB i te tino whai tikanga. Kāore mātou e hiahia ki te tūpono whakangaro raraunga i tēnei tukanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "I kitea e mātou he maha o ngā raraunga kāore i te pukapuka, pērā i ngā kiriata i ahu mai i ngā pukapuka kōmeke. He moumou hoki tēnei, i te mea kua wātea whānuitia ēnei mā ētahi atu huarahi. Heoi anō, i mārama mātou kāore e taea te tango noa i ngā kōnae kiriata, i te mea he <em>pukapuka kōmeke pāhekoheko</em> i tukuna ki te rorohiko, i hopukina e tētahi, i tiakina hei kiriata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "I te mutunga, ahakoa he aha te mea ka taea e mātou te muku i te kohinga, ka penapena noa i te torutoru ōrau. Katahi ka maumahara mātou he kaitiaki raraunga mātou, ā, ko ngā tāngata ka whakaata i tēnei he kaitiaki raraunga hoki, nā reira, “HE AHA TĀU E MEA ANA, MUKU?!” :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Nā reira, e whakaatu ana mātou ki a koe, te kohinga katoa, kāore i te whakarerekētia. He nui ngā raraunga, engari e tūmanako ana mātou ka nui te hunga e aro ana ki te whakatō i a ia ahakoa rā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Kohikohi Pūtea"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Kei te tuku mātou i ēnei raraunga i roto i ētahi poraka nui. Ko te toroa tuatahi ko te <code>/comics0</code>, i whakatakotoria e mātou ki tētahi kōnae .tar nui 12TB. He pai ake tēnei mō tō puku mārō me te pūmanawa toroa i te tini o ngā kōnae iti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "Hei wāhanga o tēnei tukunga, kei te whakahaere mātou i tētahi kohikohi pūtea. Kei te whai mātou ki te kohi $20,000 hei utu i ngā utu whakahaere me ngā utu kirimana mō tēnei kohinga, me te āhei hoki i ngā kaupapa e haere ake nei. Kei te mahi mātou i ētahi <em>maha rawa atu</em>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ko wai e tautoko ana ahau ki taku takoha?</em> I te poto: kei te tārua mātou i ngā mōhiotanga katoa me ngā ahurea o te tangata, ā, kei te whakangāwari i te urunga atu. Ko ā mātou waehere me ngā raraunga katoa he puna tuwhera, he kaupapa whakahaere tūao katoa mātou, ā, kua tiakina e mātou te 125TB o ngā pukapuka (i tua atu i ngā toroa o Libgen me Scihub e tū ana). I te mutunga, kei te hanga mātou i tētahi wīra rere e āhei ana, e whakatenatena ana i te tangata ki te kimi, ki te matawai, ki te tārua i ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao. Ka tuhi mātou mō tō mātou mahere matua i tētahi pou ā muri ake nei. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Mēnā ka takoha koe mō tētahi mema “Amazing Archivist” mō te 12 marama ($780), ka taea e koe te <strong>“whāngai i tētahi toroa”</strong>, arā, ka whakatakotoria e mātou tō ingoa kaiwhakamahi, tō karere rānei ki te ingoa kōnae o tētahi o ngā toroa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "Ka taea e koe te takoha mā te haere ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a> me te pāwhiri i te pātene “Takoha”. Kei te rapu hoki mātou i ētahi atu tūao: ngā pūkenga pūmanawa, ngā kairangahau haumarutanga, ngā tohunga kaihokohoko huna, me ngā kaiwhakamāori. Ka taea hoki e koe te tautoko i a mātou mā te tuku ratonga manaaki. Ā, kāore e kore, tēnā koa whakatō i ā mātou toroa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Ngā mihi ki te katoa kua tino tautoko i a mātou! Kei te tino whai hua koutou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Anei ngā toroa kua tukuna mai i tēnei wā (kei te tukatuka tonu mātou i te toenga):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Ka kitea ngā toroa katoa i runga i <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a> i raro i te “Datasets” (kāore mātou e hono tika ana ki reira, kia kore ai e tangohia ngā hononga ki tēnei rangitaki i Reddit, Twitter, aha atu). Mai i reira, whai i te hono ki te paetukutuku Tor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "He aha kei te haere ake?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "He pai te maha o ngā toroa mō te tiaki wā roa, engari kāore i te pai mō te urunga o ia rā. Ka mahi tahi mātou me ngā hoa manaaki ki te tuku i ēnei raraunga katoa ki te ipurangi (mai i te mea kāore Te Pūranga a Anna e manaaki i tētahi mea). Mā te mārama ka taea e koe te kimi i ēnei hononga tikiake i Te Pūranga a Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Kei te tono hoki mātou i te katoa ki te mahi i ngā mahi ki ēnei raraunga! Āwhinatia mātou ki te tātari pai ake, te whakakore i ngā tārua, te tuku ki IPFS, te whakaranu, te whakangungu i ō tauira AI ki reira, me ērā atu. Nāu katoa, ā, kāore e taea te tatari kia kite mātou he aha tāu mahi ki reira."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Hei te mutunga, e ai ki te kōrero i mua, kei te haere tonu ētahi tukunga nui (mēnā <em>tētahi</em> ka <em>tuku pōhēhē</em> i tētahi tāpae o tētahi <em>pātengi raraunga ACS4 motuhake</em>, e mōhio ana koe kei hea mātou…), me te hanga i te wīra rere mō te tārua i ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Nā reira, kia noho piri, kātahi anō mātou ka tīmata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "3x ngā pukapuka hou kua tāpirihia ki te Whakaata Pātaka Pukapuka Pirata (+24TB, 3.8 miriona pukapuka)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "I te tukunga tuatahi o te Whakaata Pātaka Pukapuka Pirata (EDIT: kua nekehia ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a>), i hanga e mātou he whakaata o Z-Library, he kohinga pukapuka hara nui. Hei whakamaharatanga, koinei tā mātou i tuhi ai i taua pou rangitaki taketake:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "He pātaka pukapuka rongonui (me te hara) a Z-Library. Kua tangohia e rātou te kohinga Library Genesis, ā, kua whakangāwari i te rapu. I tua atu, kua tino whai hua rātou ki te tono i ngā takoha pukapuka hou, mā te whakatenatena i ngā kaiwhakamahi takoha ki ngā momo painga. I tēnei wā kāore rātou e whakahoki i ēnei pukapuka hou ki Library Genesis. Ā, kāore i rite ki Library Genesis, kāore rātou e whakangāwari ana i te whakaata i tā rātou kohinga, e aukati ana i te tiaki whānui. He mea nui tēnei ki tā rātou tauira pakihi, mai i te mea ka utu rātou i te moni mō te urunga ki tā rātou kohinga i te nuinga (neke atu i te 10 pukapuka ia rā)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text2"
msgstr "Kāore mātou e whakatau i ngā tikanga mō te utu moni mō te uru nui ki tētahi kohinga pukapuka ture kore. Kāore he feaa kua angitū te Z-Library ki te whakawhānui i te uru ki te mātauranga, me te rapu pukapuka anō. Kei konei noa mātou ki te mahi i tā mātou wāhanga: te whakarite i te tiaki mo te wā roa o tēnei kohinga tūmataiti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text2"
msgstr "I tīmata taua kohinga i te waenganui o te tau 2021. I taua wā, kua tipu te Z-Library i te tere mīharo: kua tāpirihia e rātou tata ki te 3.8 miriona pukapuka hou. He maha ngā tārua i reira, engari ko te nuinga he pukapuka hou tūturu, he kape kounga teitei ake rānei o ngā pukapuka i tukuna i mua. Nā te nui ake o ngā kaiwhakahaere tūao i te Z-Library, me tā rātou pūnaha tuku nui me te whakakore tārua. E hiahia ana mātou ki te mihi ki a rātou mō ēnei whakatutukitanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text3"
msgstr "E hari ana mātou ki te pānui kua riro mai i a mātou ngā pukapuka katoa i tāpirihia ki te Z-Library i waenga i tā mātou whakaata whakamutunga me Ākuhata 2022. Kua hoki whakamuri hoki mātou ki te kohi i ētahi pukapuka i ngaro i a mātou i te wā tuatahi. Ko te katoa o tēnei kohinga hou he 24TB, he nui ake i te kohinga whakamutunga (7TB). Kua 31TB te katoa o tā mātou whakaata. I whakakore anō mātou i ngā tārua ki te Library Genesis, i te mea kua wātea kē ngā awa mō taua kohinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text4"
msgstr "Tēnā haere ki te Pirate Library Mirror ki te tiro i te kohinga hou (EDIT: kua neke ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a>). He nui ake ngā mōhiohio i reira mō te hanganga o ngā kōnae, me ngā huringa mai i te wā whakamutunga. Kāore mātou e hono atu i konei, i te mea he paetukutuku rangitaki noa tēnei kāore e manaaki i ngā rawa ture kore."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text5"
msgstr "He tino pai te tuku i ngā awa hei āwhina i a mātou. Ngā mihi ki te katoa e tuku ana i ngā awa o mua. E mihi ana mātou mō te urupare pai, me te hari hoki he maha ngā tāngata e aro ana ki te tiaki i te mātauranga me te ahurea i roto i tēnei ara rerekē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.title"
msgstr "Me pēhea te noho hei kaitiaki pūranga pirata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.tldr"
msgstr "Ko te wero tuatahi pea he mea ohorere. Ehara i te raru hangarau, i te raru ture rānei. He raru hinengaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates"
msgstr "I mua i te ruku atu, e rua ngā whakahou i te Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kua neke ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a>):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item1"
msgstr "I whiwhi mātou i ētahi takoha tino atawhai. Ko te tuatahi he $10k mai i tētahi tangata ingoamuna i tautoko hoki i a \"bookwarrior\", te kaiwhakarewa taketake o Library Genesis. He mihi nui ki a bookwarrior mō te whakahaerenga o tēnei takoha. Ko te tuarua he $10k anō mai i tētahi kaitakoha ingoamuna, i whakapā mai i muri i tā mātou tukunga whakamutunga, ā, i whakaaweawe ki te āwhina. He maha hoki ngā takoha iti ake. Ngā mihi nui mō tō koutou tautoko atawhai. Kei te haere mai ētahi kaupapa hou whakahihiri ka tautokohia e tēnei, nō reira kia mataara."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.updates.item2"
msgstr "I raru mātou i ētahi uauatanga hangarau i te rahi o tā mātou tukunga tuarua, engari kei te tuku me te tuku mātou i ngā awa ināianei. I whiwhi hoki mātou i tētahi tuku atawhai mai i tētahi tangata ingoamuna ki te tuku i tā mātou kohinga ki runga i ō rātou tūmau tere-tere rawa, nō reira kei te tuku motuhake mātou ki ō rātou mīhini, ā, i muri i tērā ka kite te katoa e tango ana i te kohinga i te tino tere ake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text1"
msgstr "Ka taea te tuhi pukapuka katoa mō te <em>aha</em> o te tiaki matihiko i te nuinga, me te kaitiakitanga pirata i te mea motuhake, engari me tuku he aratohu tere mō te hunga kāore i te tino mōhio. Kei te whakaputa te ao i te nui ake o te mātauranga me te ahurea i mua atu, engari kei te ngaro hoki te nuinga atu i mua atu. Ka whakawhirinaki te tangata ki ngā kamupene pēnei i ngā kaiwhakaputa mātauranga, ngā ratonga roma, me ngā kamupene pāpāho pāpori ki tēnei taonga tuku iho, ā, kāore rātou i te tino kaitiaki pai. Tirohia te pakipūmeka Digital Amnesia, me ngā kōrero a Jason Scott."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text2"
msgstr "He ētahi whakahaere e pai ana te mahi ki te puranga i te nui o ngā mea ka taea e rātou, engari ka herea rātou e te ture. Hei pirata, kei a mātou te tūranga ahurei ki te puranga i ngā kohinga kāore e taea e rātou te pa atu, nā te whakatinanatanga o te mana pupuri, ētahi atu here rānei. Ka taea hoki e mātou te whakaata i ngā kohinga i ngā wā maha, puta noa i te ao, hei whakanui i te tūponotanga o te tiaki tika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.text3"
msgstr "I tēnei wā, kāore mātou e uru ki ngā kōrero mō ngā painga me ngā huakore o te rawa hinengaro, te tikanga o te takahi i te ture, ngā whakaaro mō te aukati, te take o te uru ki te mātauranga me te ahurea rānei. Kua oti katoa ēnei, me ruku ki te <em>me pēhea</em>. Ka tohatoha mātou i te ara i noho ai tō mātou rōpū hei kaitiaki pūranga pirata, me ngā akoranga i akohia e mātou i te ara. He maha ngā wero ka pā ki a koe i te tīmatanga o tēnei haerenga, ā, ko te tūmanako ka taea e mātou te āwhina i a koe i ētahi o ēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community"
msgstr "Hapori"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text1"
msgstr "Ko te wero tuatahi pea he mea ohorere. Ehara i te raru hangarau, i te raru ture rānei. He raru hinengaro: ko te mahi i tēnei mahi i roto i te atarangi ka tino mokemoke. I runga i te mea e whakamahere ana koe ki te mahi, me tō tauira mōrearea, me tino tūpato koe. I tētahi pito o te whānuitanga kei a mātou ngā tāngata pēnei i a Alexandra Elbakyan*, te kaiwhakarewa o Sci-Hub, e tino mārama ana ki āna mahi. Engari kei te mōrearea nui ia ki te mauheretia mēnā ka toro ia ki tētahi whenua uru i tēnei wā, ā, ka taea te whiua ki ngā tekau tau o te wā i te whare herehere. He mōrearea tēnā e pai ana koe ki te tango? Kei te pito kē o te whānuitanga mātou; e tino tūpato ana kia kaua e waiho he tohu, me te whai haumaru whakahaere kaha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text2"
msgstr "* Ka rite ki te kōrero i runga i HN e \"ynno\", kāore a Alexandra i hiahia kia mōhiotia i te tuatahi: \"I whakaritea āna tūmau ki te tuku karere hapa taipitopito mai i te PHP, tae atu ki te ara katoa o te kōnae puna hē, i raro i te kōpaki /home/ringo-ring, ka taea te whai ki tētahi ingoa kaiwhakamahi i a ia i runga i tētahi pae kāore e hāngai ana, e piri ana ki tōna ingoa tūturu. I mua i tēnei whakakitenga, he ingoamuna ia.\" Nō reira, whakamahia ngā ingoa kaiwhakamahi matapōkere i runga i ngā rorohiko e whakamahia ana e koe mō ēnei mea, mēnā ka hē tō whakaritenga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text3"
msgstr "Heoi, ko taua huna, he utu hinengaro. He pai ki te nuinga o te tangata te mōhiotia mō ā rātou mahi, engari kāore e taea e koe te tango i tētahi whiwhinga mō tēnei i te ao tūturu. Ahakoa ngā mea māmā ka uaua, pēnei i te pātai a ngā hoa he aha āu mahi (i tētahi wā ka hōhā te \"whakapoapoa i taku NAS / homelab\")."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text4"
msgstr "Koinei te take he mea nui kia kitea he hapori. Ka taea e koe te tuku i ētahi haumaru whakahaere mā te whakawhirinaki ki ētahi hoa tino tata, e mōhio ana koe ka taea e koe te whakawhirinaki hohonu. Ahakoa i reira me tūpato kia kaua e tuhi i tētahi mea, mēnā me tuku ā rātou īmēra ki ngā mana whakahaere, mēnā rānei kua pakaru ō rātou taputapu i tētahi atu ara."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text5"
msgstr "He pai ake te kimi i ētahi atu pirata. Mēnā kei te hiahia ō hoa tata ki te hono atu ki a koe, he pai! Ki te kore, ka taea pea e koe te kimi i ētahi atu i runga ipurangi. Heoi, he hapori iti tonu tēnei. I tēnei wā kua kitea e mātou he tokoiti noa atu e kaha ana i tēnei wāhi. Ko ngā wāhi tīmatanga pai ko ngā huinga Library Genesis, me r/DataHoarder. Kei te Archive Team hoki ētahi tāngata rite te whakaaro, ahakoa kei te mahi rātou i roto i te ture (ahakoa i ētahi wāhi hina o te ture). Kei ngā ahurea tuku \"warez\" me te pirata hoki ētahi tāngata e whakaaro ana i ngā ara ōrite."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.community.text6"
msgstr "Kei te tuwhera mātou ki ngā whakaaro mō te whakatipu hapori me te torotoro i ngā whakaaro. Kaua e māharahara ki te tuku karere mai ki a mātou i runga i a Twitter, i a Reddit rānei. Tērā pea ka taea e mātou te whakahaere i tētahi momo huinga kōrero, rōpū kōrerorero rānei. Ko tētahi wero ko te māmā o te aukati i tēnei ina whakamahi i ngā tūāpapa noa, nō reira me whakahaere e mātou anake. He tauhokohoko anō hoki i waenga i te whai i ēnei kōrero kia tino tūmatanui (he nui ake te whai wāhi) ki te hanga tūmataiti (kia kaua e mōhio ngā \"whāinga\" pea kei te tata mātou ki te keri i a rātou). Me whakaaro mātou mō tēnei. Korerotia mai mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki tēnei!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects"
msgstr "Ngā Kaupapa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text1"
msgstr "Ina mahi mātou i tētahi kaupapa, he maha ngā wāhanga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase1"
msgstr "Te kōwhiri i te wāhi / te kaupapa: Kei hea koe e hiahia ana ki te arotahi, ā, he aha ai? He aha ōu anō ngākaunui, pūkenga, āhuatanga hoki ka taea e koe te whakamahi hei painga mōu?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase2"
msgstr "Te kōwhiri i te whāinga: Ko tēhea kohinga motuhake ka tāruatia e koe?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase3"
msgstr "Te keri metadata: Te whakarārangi mōhiohio mō ngā kōnae, me te kore e tīkina ngā kōnae (he nui ake te rahi) ake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase4"
msgstr "Te kōwhiri raraunga: I runga i te metadata, te whāiti i te raraunga tino hāngai ki te puranga i tēnei wā. Tērā pea ko ngā mea katoa, engari he ara whaitake tonu hei whakaora i te mokowā me te whanui."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase5"
msgstr "Te keri raraunga: Te tiki i te raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.phase6"
msgstr "Te tohatoha: Te whakakakahu i roto i ngā toroa, te pānui i tētahi wāhi, te tono i te tangata ki te hora."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.text2"
msgstr "Ehara ēnei i te tino motuhake ngā wāhanga, ā, he maha ngā wā ka whakahokia koe e ngā māramatanga mai i tētahi wāhanga ki tētahi wāhanga o mua. Hei tauira, i te wā o te keri metadata ka mōhio pea koe kei te whāinga i kōwhiria e koe he tikanga ārai i tua atu i tō taumata pūkenga (pērā i ngā aukati IP), nō reira ka hoki koe ki te kimi i tētahi whāinga kē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain"
msgstr "1. Te kōwhiri i te wāhi / te kaupapa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text1"
msgstr "Kāore he kore o te mātauranga me te taonga tuku iho ahurea hei tiaki, ā, ka tino taumaha. Koia i te wā e whai hua ana ki te whai wāhi ki te whakaaro mō tō koha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text2"
msgstr "He rerekē te whakaaro o tēnā, o tēnā, engari anei ētahi pātai ka taea e koe te pātai ki a koe anō:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.why"
msgstr "He aha koe i hiahia ai ki tēnei? He aha ōu anō ngākaunui? Mēnā ka taea e mātou te tiki i te rōpū tangata e puranga ana i ngā momo mea e tino aro ana rātou, ka kapi te nuinga! Ka mōhio koe ki te nui atu i te tangata toharite mō tōu anō ngākaunui, pērā i te aha te raraunga nui hei tiaki, he aha ngā kohinga pai me ngā hapori ipurangi, me ērā atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.skills"
msgstr "He aha ngā pūkenga kei a koe ka taea e koe te whakamahi hei painga mōu? Hei tauira, mēnā he tohunga haumaru ipurangi koe, ka taea e koe te kimi huarahi ki te hinga i ngā aukati IP mō ngā whāinga haumaru. Mēnā he pai koe ki te whakarite hapori, tērā pea ka taea e koe te whakakotahi i ētahi tangata ki tētahi whāinga. He pai te mōhio ki ētahi hōtaka ahakoa mō te pupuri i te haumaru whakahaere pai i roto i tēnei tukanga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.time"
msgstr "E hia te wā kei a koe mō tēnei? Ko tā mātou tohutohu ko te tīmata iti, ā, ka mahi i ngā kaupapa nui ake i te wā ka mārama koe, engari ka pau katoa te wā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.target"
msgstr "He aha te wāhi nui hei arotahi? Mēnā ka whakapau koe i te X hāora ki te puranga pirau, me pēhea e taea ai e koe te whiwhi i te \"bang for your buck\" nui rawa?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.why.thinking"
msgstr "He aha ngā huarahi ahurei e whakaaro ana koe mō tēnei? Tērā pea kei a koe ētahi whakaaro, huarahi rānei e ngaro ana i ētahi atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.domain.text3"
msgstr "I tō mātou take, i aro mātou ki te tiaki roa o te pūtaiao. I mōhio mātou mō Library Genesis, me te pēhea i tāruatia katoatia ai i ngā wā maha mā te whakamahi i ngā toroa. I aroha mātou ki taua whakaaro. Katahi ka tētahi o mātou i ngana ki te kimi i ētahi pukapuka pūtaiao i runga i Library Genesis, engari kāore i kitea, ka whakatūpato i te tino oti o tēnei. Katahi ka rapu mātou i aua pukapuka ipurangi, ā, i kitea i ētahi atu wāhi, i whakatō i te kākano mō tō mātou kaupapa. Ahakoa i mua i te mōhio ki te Z-Library, i whai whakaaro mātou ki te kore e ngana ki te kohikohi ā-ringa i aua pukapuka katoa, engari ki te arotahi ki te tārua i ngā kohinga e tū ana, me te tuku i a rātou ki Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target"
msgstr "2. Te kōwhiri i te whāinga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text1"
msgstr "Nō reira, kei a tātou tō tātou wāhi e titiro ana, ināianei ko tēhea kohinga motuhake ka tāruatia e tātou? E rua ngā mea e pai ana hei whāinga pai:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.large"
msgstr "Rahi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.unique"
msgstr "Ahurei: kāore anō kia tino kapi e ētahi atu kaupapa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.accessible"
msgstr "Wātea: kāore e whakamahi i te maha o ngā papa whakamarumaru hei aukati i a koe ki te tango i ō rātou metadata me ngā raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.insight"
msgstr "Mātauranga motuhake: kei a koe ētahi mōhiohio motuhake mō tēnei whāinga, pēnei i te whai wāhi motuhake ki tēnei kohinga, i te mōhio rānei ki te hinga i ō rātou whakamarumaru. Ehara tēnei i te mea e hiahiatia ana (kāore tō mātou kaupapa e whai ake nei e mahi i tētahi mea motuhake), engari he tino āwhina!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text2"
msgstr "I te wā i kitea ai e mātou ā mātou pukapuka pūtaiao i runga i ngā paetukutuku kē atu i te Library Genesis, i ngana mātou ki te mārama me pēhea i puta ai rātou ki te ipurangi. I kitea e mātou te Z-Library, ā, i mōhio ai mātou ahakoa kāore te nuinga o ngā pukapuka e puta tuatahi ana ki reira, ka mutu ka tae atu rātou ki reira. I ako mātou mō tōna hononga ki te Library Genesis, me te hanganga whakatenatena (pūtea) me te atanga kaiwhakamahi pai ake, i pai ake ai te kohinga. I muri mai, i mahi mātou i ētahi tangohanga metadata me ngā raraunga, ā, i mōhio ai mātou ka taea e mātou te karo i ō rātou here tikiake IP, mā te whakamahi i te uru motuhake a tētahi o ā mātou mema ki te maha o ngā tūmau takawaenga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.target.text3"
msgstr "I a koe e tūhura ana i ngā whāinga rerekē, he mea nui kē ki te huna i ō ara mā te whakamahi i ngā VPN me ngā wāhitau īmēra tuku, ka kōrero atu mātou mō tēnei ā muri ake nei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata"
msgstr "3. Te tango metadata"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text1"
msgstr "Kia ruku hohonu ake tātou ki konei. Mo te tango metadata mai i ngā paetukutuku, kua noho māmā noa iho ngā mea. Ka whakamahi mātou i ngā hōtuhi Python, i ētahi wā ko te curl, me tētahi pātengi raraunga MySQL hei pupuri i ngā hua. Kāore anō mātou kia whakamahi i tētahi pūmanawa tango raraunga mīharo e taea ai te mapi i ngā paetukutuku matatini, nā te mea i tēnei wā kua hiahia noa mātou ki te tango i tētahi, e rua rānei ngā momo whārangi mā te tatau noa i ngā id me te tātari i te HTML. Mēnā kāore he whārangi e taea ana te tatau, kātahi pea ka hiahia koe ki tētahi pūrere keri raraunga tika e ngana ana ki te kimi i ngā whārangi katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text2"
msgstr "I mua i tō tīmata ki te tango i tētahi paetukutuku katoa, ngana ki te mahi ā-ringa mō tētahi wā poto. Haere i roto i ētahi whārangi tekau mā rua, kia mōhio ai koe me pēhea te mahi. I ētahi wā ka pāngia koe e ngā aukati IP, i ētahi atu whanonga whakamere rānei i tēnei ara. Ka pēnei anō mō te tango raraunga: i mua i te ruku hohonu ki tēnei whāinga, kia mōhio ai koe ka taea e koe te tikiake i ōna raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text3"
msgstr "Hei karo i ngā here, he maha ngā mea ka taea e koe te whakamātau. He wāhitau IP, he tūmau rānei e pupuri ana i ngā raraunga kotahi engari kāore i te herea? He wāhi API kāore i te herea, i te wā e herea ana ētahi atu? I te aha te tere o te tikiake ka aukatia tō IP, ā, mō te aha te roa? Ka aukatia koe, ka whakaitihia rānei? Ka aha mēnā ka hanga koe i tētahi pūkete kaiwhakamahi, ka pēhea te rerekē o ngā mea i reira? Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i te HTTP/2 ki te pupuri i ngā hononga tuwhera, ā, ka piki ake te tere e taea ai e koe te tono whārangi? He whārangi kei reira e rārangi ana i ngā kōnae maha i te wā kotahi, ā, he nui te mōhiohio kei reira?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text4"
msgstr "Ko ngā mea pea e hiahia ana koe ki te tiaki ko:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.title"
msgstr "Taitara"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.location"
msgstr "Ingoa kōnae / wāhi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.id"
msgstr "ID: ka taea te ID ā-roto, engari he pai hoki ngā ID pērā i te ISBN, DOI rānei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.size"
msgstr "Rahi: hei tatau i te nui o te mokowā kōpae e hiahiatia ana e koe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.hash"
msgstr "Hash (md5, sha1): hei whakaū i te tika o te tikiake i te kōnae."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.dates"
msgstr "Rā tāpiri/whakarerekē: kia taea ai e koe te hoki mai ā muri ake nei ki te tikiake i ngā kōnae kāore anō koe kia tikiake i mua (ahakoa ka taea hoki e koe te whakamahi i te ID, hash rānei mō tēnei)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.notes"
msgstr "Whakaahuatanga, kāwai, tūtohu, kaituhi, reo, aha atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text5"
msgstr "Ka mahi mātou i tēnei i roto i ngā wāhanga e rua. Tuatahi ka tikiake mātou i ngā kōnae HTML taketake, i te nuinga o te wā ki roto i te MySQL (kia kore ai e maha ngā kōnae iti, ka kōrero atu mātou mō tēnei i raro nei). Ka mutu, i tētahi wāhanga motuhake, ka haere mātou i roto i aua kōnae HTML, ka tātari i a rātou ki ngā ripanga MySQL tūturu. Mā tēnei kāore koe e hiahia ki te tikiake anō i ngā mea katoa mai i te tīmatanga mēnā ka kitea he hapa i tō waehere tātari, nā te mea ka taea e koe te tukatuka anō i ngā kōnae HTML me te waehere hou. He māmā ake hoki te tukatuka i te wāhanga tukatuka, ka penapena i te wā (ka taea hoki e koe te tuhi i te waehere tukatuka i te wā e rere ana te tango raraunga, kaua ki te tuhi i ngā wāhanga e rua i te wā kotahi)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.metadata.text6"
msgstr "Hei whakamutunga, kia mōhio koe mō ētahi whāinga ko te keri metadata anake te mahi. He nui ngā kohinga metadata kei reira kāore i te tiakina tika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data"
msgstr "4. Kōwhiringa Raraunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text1"
msgstr "He maha ngā wā ka taea e koe te whakamahi i te metadata ki te kimi i tētahi huinga raraunga whaitake hei tikiake. Ahakoa ka hiahia koe ki te tikiake i ngā raraunga katoa i te mutunga, he pai tonu te aro ki ngā mea tino hira i te tuatahi, mēnā ka kitea koe, ka whakapai ake ngā parepare, ka hiahia rānei koe ki te hoko kōpae anō, he mea kē atu rānei ka puta i tō oranga i mua i tō taea te tikiake i ngā mea katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text2"
msgstr "Hei tauira, tērā pea he maha ngā putanga o te rauemi kotahi (pērā i te pukapuka, i te kiriata rānei) i roto i tētahi kohinga, ā, kua tohua tētahi hei putanga kounga pai rawa atu. He pai te tiaki i aua putanga i te tuatahi. Tērā pea ka hiahia koe ki te tiaki i ngā putanga katoa i te mutunga, nā te mea i ētahi wā ka hē te tohu o te metadata, tērā rānei pea he rerekētanga kāore i te mōhiotia i waenga i ngā putanga (hei tauira, tērā pea ko te \"putanga pai rawa atu\" te mea pai i te nuinga o ngā āhuatanga engari he kino i ētahi atu āhuatanga, pērā i te kiriata he taumira teitei ake engari kāore he kupu hauraro)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text3"
msgstr "Ka taea hoki e koe te rapu i tō pātengi raraunga metadata ki te kimi i ngā mea whakamere. He aha te kōnae nui rawa atu e whakairihia ana, ā, he aha i tino nui ai? He aha te kōnae iti rawa atu? He tauira whakamere, ohorere rānei kei ngā kāwai, reo, aha atu rānei? He taitara tārua, tino ōrite rānei? He tauira kei te wā i tāpirihia ai ngā raraunga, pērā i tētahi rā i tāpirihia ai he maha o ngā kōnae i te wā kotahi? He maha ngā mea ka taea e koe te ako mā te titiro ki te huinga raraunga i ngā huarahi rerekē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.data.text4"
msgstr "I tō mātou take, i whakakorekore mātou i ngā pukapuka Z-Library ki ngā hātepe md5 i roto i te Library Genesis, nā reira i nui te wā me te mokowā kōpae i tiakina. He āhuatanga ahurei tēnei ahakoa. I te nuinga o ngā wā kāore he pātengi raraunga whānui mō ngā kōnae kua tiakina tika e ngā kaipahua hoa. He whai wāhitanga nui tēnei mō tētahi tangata i reira. He rawe te whai i tētahi tirohanga hou e whakahōutia ana i ngā mea pērā i te puoro me ngā kiriata kua tino purua ki ngā paetukutuku awa, ā, nā reira he iti ake te kaupapa matua ki te whakauru ki ngā whakaata kaipahua."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping"
msgstr "5. Keri Raraunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text1"
msgstr "Kua rite koe ināianei ki te tikiake i ngā raraunga i te rahinga nui. Ka rite ki te kī i mua, i tēnei wā me kua tikiake ā-ringa koe i te maha o ngā kōnae, kia pai ake ai tō mārama ki ngā whanonga me ngā here o te whāinga. Heoi anō, ka puta tonu he ohorere ki a koe i te wā ka tīmata koe ki te tikiake i te maha o ngā kōnae i te wā kotahi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text2"
msgstr "Ko tā mātou tohutohu i konei he pupuri i ngā mea kia māmā. Tīmata mā te tikiake noa i te maha o ngā kōnae. Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i te Python, ā, ka whakawhānui ki ngā miro maha. Engari i ētahi wā he māmā ake te whakaputa kōnae Bash tika mai i te pātengi raraunga, ā, ka whakahaere i te maha o ēnei i roto i ngā matapihi tauranga maha hei whakawhānui. He tinihanga hangarau tere e tika ana kia whakahuahia i konei ko te whakamahi i te OUTFILE i roto i te MySQL, ka taea e koe te tuhi ki hea mēnā ka whakakore koe i te \"secure_file_priv\" i roto i te mysqld.cnf (me mātua whakakore/whakakapi hoki i te AppArmor mēnā kei runga koe i te Linux)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text3"
msgstr "Ka rokiroki mātou i ngā raraunga ki runga i ngā kōpae mārō māmā. Tīmata ki te mea kei a koe, ā, ka whakawhānui āta. He taumaha te whakaaro mō te rokiroki i ngā rau o ngā TB o ngā raraunga. Mēnā koinei te āhuatanga kei mua i a koe, tukuna he huinga pai i te tuatahi, ā, i roto i tō pānui tono āwhina mō te rokiroki i te toenga. Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te tiki kōpae mārō anō, kei r/DataHoarder ētahi rauemi pai mō te whiwhi utu pai."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text4"
msgstr "Kaua e āwangawanga rawa mō ngā pūnaha kōnae huatau. He māmā te taka ki te rua kiore o te whakatū i ngā mea pērā i te ZFS. He taipitopito hangarau kotahi kia mōhiotia, he maha ngā pūnaha kōnae kāore e pai te mahi ki te maha o ngā kōnae. Kua kitea e mātou he māmā te hanga i ngā kōpaki maha, hei tauira mō ngā awhe ID rerekē, mō ngā tīmatanga hātepe rānei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.scraping.text5"
msgstr "I muri i te tikiake i ngā raraunga, kia mātua tirohia te tika o ngā kōnae mā te whakamahi i ngā hātepe i roto i te metadata, mēnā kei te wātea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution"
msgstr "6. Tohatoha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text1"
msgstr "Kei a koe ngā raraunga, nā reira kei a koe te whakaata kaipahua tuatahi o te ao mō tō whāinga (tērā pea). I ngā huarahi maha kua mutu te wāhanga uaua rawa, engari kei mua tonu i a koe te wāhanga mōrearea rawa. I te mutunga, i tēnei wā kua noho huna koe; e rere ana i raro i te radar. Ko tāu noa iho he whakamahi i tētahi VPN pai i te roanga atu, kaua e whakakī i ō taipitopito whaiaro ki ngā puka (duh), ā, tērā pea he whakamahi i tētahi wāhanga pūtirotiro motuhake (rānei he rorohiko rerekē)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text2"
msgstr "Ināianei me tohatoha koe i ngā raraunga. I tō mātou take i hiahia mātou ki te tuku i ngā pukapuka ki te Library Genesis, engari i tere kitea ngā uauatanga i roto i tērā (te whakarōpū pakiwaitara vs kore-pakiwaitara). Nā reira i whakatau mātou ki te tohatoha mā te whakamahi i ngā awa Library Genesis-style. Mēnā he whai wāhitanga koe ki te tuku ki tētahi kaupapa e tū ana, ka taea e tērā te whakaora i te maha o te wā. Heoi anō, kāore i te maha ngā whakaata kaipahua kua whakaritea pai i reira i tēnei wā."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text3"
msgstr "Nā reira me kī koe ka whakatau koe ki te tohatoha i ngā awa koe anake. Me pupuri i aua kōnae kia iti, kia māmā ai te whakaata i runga i ētahi atu paetukutuku. Ka whai koe ki te puru i ngā awa koe anake, i te wā e noho huna tonu ana. Ka taea e koe te whakamahi i tētahi VPN (me te kore rānei o te tuku tauranga), te utu rānei ki ngā Bitcoins tumbled mō tētahi Pouaka Purapura. Mēnā kāore koe i te mōhio ki te tikanga o ētahi o aua kupu, ka whai pānui koe, nā te mea he mea nui kia mārama koe ki ngā rerekētanga mōrearea i konei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text4"
msgstr "Ka taea e koe te manaaki i ngā kōnae awa i runga i ngā paetukutuku awa e tū ana. I tō mātou take, i whiriwhiri mātou ki te manaaki i tētahi paetukutuku, nā te mea i hiahia hoki mātou ki te hora i tō mātou kaupapa i runga i te huarahi mārama. Ka taea e koe te mahi i tēnei āu anō i te āhua ōrite (ka whakamahi mātou i te Njalla mō ō mātou rohe me te manaaki, i utua ki ngā Bitcoins tumbled), engari ka taea hoki te whakapā mai ki a mātou kia manaaki mātou i ō awa. Kei te rapu mātou ki te hanga i tētahi rārangi whānui o ngā whakaata kaipahua i te roanga o te wā, mēnā ka mau tēnei whakaaro."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text5"
msgstr "Mō te kōwhiringa VPN, kua nui kē te tuhi mō tēnei, nā reira ka whakahoki noa i te tohutohu whānui o te kōwhiri mā te ingoa pai. Ko ngā kaupapa here kore-rangitaki kua whakamātauria e te kōti me ngā rekoata roa o te tiaki i te tūmataiti te kōwhiringa mōrearea iti rawa, ki tā mātou whakaaro. Kia mōhio ahakoa ka mahi koe i ngā mea katoa tika, kāore e taea te whakaiti i te mōrearea ki te kore. Hei tauira, i te wā e puru ana i ō awa, tērā pea ka taea e tētahi kaiwhakatūpato ā-motu te titiro ki ngā rerenga raraunga e haere mai ana, e puta atu ana mō ngā tūmau VPN, ā, ka whakatau ko wai koe. Ka taea rānei e koe te hē noa iho. Tērā pea kua hē kē mātou, ā, ka hē anō. Waimarie, kāore ngā kāwanatanga ā-motu e aro <em>nui</em> ana ki te kaipahua."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text6"
msgstr "Ko tētahi whakatau hei hanga mō ia kaupapa, ko te whakaputa i raro i te ingoa ōrite i mua, kāore rānei. Mēnā ka whakamahi tonu koe i te ingoa ōrite, ka hoki mai pea ngā hapa i te haumaru whakahaere mai i ngā kaupapa o mua ki te ngau i a koe. Engari ko te whakaputa i raro i ngā ingoa rerekē ka kore koe e hanga i tētahi ingoa roa e mau ana. I whiriwhiri mātou ki te whai i te haumaru whakahaere kaha mai i te tīmatanga kia taea ai e mātou te whakamahi tonu i te ingoa ōrite, engari kāore mātou e whakaroa ki te whakaputa i raro i tētahi ingoa rerekē mēnā ka hē mātou, mēnā rānei ka karanga ngā āhuatanga mō tēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.projects.distribution.text7"
msgstr "He uaua te tuku i te kupu. Ka rite ki tā mātou kī, he hapori whāiti tonu tēnei. I te tuatahi i tuku mātou ki Reddit, engari i tino whai pānga ki Hacker News. I tēnei wā ko tā mātou tūtohu he tuku ki ētahi wāhi torutoru, ā, tirohia te aha ka puta. Ā, anō, whakapā mai ki a mātou. E hiahia ana mātou ki te hora i te kupu mō ngā mahi kaipahua pukapuka anō."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion"
msgstr "Whakamutunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Ko te tumanako he awhina tenei mo nga kaitiaki puranga pirata hou. Kei te harikoa matou ki te powhiri i a koe ki tenei ao, no reira kaua e whakaroa ki te toro mai. Me tiaki e tatou te nui o te matauranga me te ahurea o te ao ka taea, ka whakaatahia ki tawhiti me te whanui."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.title"
msgstr "Te Whakaaturanga o te Whakaata Whare Pukapuka Pirata: Te Tiaki i te 7TB o nga pukapuka (e kore e kitea i Libgen)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text1"
msgstr "Ko tenei kaupapa (EDIT: kua nekehia ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Puranga a Anna</a>) e whai ana ki te tuku i te tiaki me te whakarangatira i te matauranga tangata. Ka tuku matou i ta matou takoha iti, i runga i nga tapuwae o nga rangatira i mua i a matou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text2"
msgstr "Ko te aronga o tenei kaupapa e whakaatuhia ana e tona ingoa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.pirate"
msgstr "<strong>Pirata</strong> - Ka takahi matou i te ture mana pupuri i te nuinga o nga whenua. Ma tenei ka taea e matou te mahi i tetahi mea e kore e taea e nga hinonga ture: te whakarite kia whakaatahia nga pukapuka ki tawhiti me te whanui."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.library"
msgstr "<strong>Whare Pukapuka</strong> - Pērā i te nuinga o ngā whare pukapuka, ka aro mātou ki ngā rauemi tuhituhi pērā i ngā pukapuka. Ka taea pea e matou te whakawhānui atu ki ētahi atu momo pāpāho ā muri ake nei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.focus.mirror"
msgstr "<strong>Whakaata</strong> - He whakaata noa matou o nga whare pukapuka o naianei. Ka aro matou ki te tiaki, kaua ki te hanga pukapuka kia ngawari te rapu me te tango (urunga) me te whakatipu i te hapori nui o nga tangata e tuku ana i nga pukapuka hou (puna)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text3"
msgstr "Ko te whare pukapuka tuatahi i whakaatahia e matou ko Z-Library. He whare pukapuka rongonui (me te ture kore) tenei. Kua tangohia e ratou te kohinga Library Genesis ka ngawari te rapu. I tua atu i tera, kua tino whai hua ratou ki te tono takoha pukapuka hou, ma te whakatenatena i nga kaiwhakamahi e tuku ana me nga momo painga. I tenei wa kaore ratou e tuku i enei pukapuka hou ki te Library Genesis. A kaore i rite ki te Library Genesis, kaore ratou e ngawari te whakaata i ta ratou kohinga, ka aukati i te tiaki whanui. He mea nui tenei ki ta ratou tauira pakihi, na te mea ka utu ratou mo te uru atu ki ta ratou kohinga i te nuinga (neke atu i te 10 pukapuka ia ra)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text4"
msgstr "Kāore mātou e whakatau i ngā tikanga mō te utu moni mō te uru nui ki tētahi kohinga pukapuka ture kore. Kāore he feaa kua angitū te Z-Library ki te whakawhānui i te uru ki te mātauranga, me te rapu pukapuka anō. Kei konei noa mātou ki te mahi i tā mātou wāhanga: te whakarite i te tiaki mo te wā roa o tēnei kohinga tūmataiti."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text5"
msgstr "E hiahia ana matou ki te tono i a koe ki te awhina i te tiaki me te whakarangatira i te matauranga tangata ma te tango me te whakato i a matou awa. Tirohia te wharangi kaupapa mo etahi atu korero mo te whakariterite o nga raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.text6"
msgstr "Ka tino tono hoki matou ki a koe ki te tuku i o whakaaro mo nga kohinga hei whakaata i muri mai, me pehea te mahi. Ka taea e tatou te whakatutuki i te maha. He iti noa tenei takoha i roto i te maha o etahi atu. Nga mihi, mo nga mea katoa e mahia ana e koe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.introducing.footnote"
msgstr "<em>Kaore matou e hono atu ki nga konae mai i tenei rangitaki. Tena rapua e koe.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.title"
msgstr "Te putunga ISBNdb, me te E hia nga Pukapuka ka Tiakina mo ake tonu atu?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.tldr"
msgstr "Mena ka tika ta tatou whakakore i nga konae mai i nga whare pukapuka atarangi, he aha te paheketanga o nga pukapuka katoa o te ao kua tiakina e tatou?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text1"
msgstr "Ma te Whakaata Whare Pukapuka Pirata (EDIT: kua nekehia ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Puranga a Anna</a>), ko ta matou whainga ko te tango i nga pukapuka katoa o te ao, ka tiaki mo ake tonu atu.<sup>1</sup> I waenga i a matou awa Z-Library, me nga awa taketake o Library Genesis, kei a matou nga konae 11,783,153. Engari e hia tena, tino? Mena ka tika ta tatou whakakore i aua konae, he aha te paheketanga o nga pukapuka katoa o te ao kua tiakina e tatou? E tino hiahia ana matou ki te whai i tetahi mea penei:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.10%"
msgstr "10% oo te taonga tuhituhi a te tangata kua tiakina mo ake tonu atu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text2"
msgstr "Mo te paheketanga, me whai tatou i te tau whakarea: te katoa o nga pukapuka i whakaputaina.<sup>2</sup> I mua i te hinganga o Google Books, i ngana tetahi kaipūkaha i te kaupapa, a Leonid Taycher, <a %(booksearch_blogspot)s>ki te whakatau tata</a> i tenei nama. I puta mai ia — he whakakatakata — me te 129,864,880 (“i te iti rawa tae noa ki te Ratapu”). I whakatau tata ia i tenei nama ma te hanga i te papaarangi kotahi o nga pukapuka katoa o te ao. Mo tenei, i kohikohi ia i nga huinga raraunga rereke ka whakakotahi i a raatau i roto i nga huarahi rereke."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text3"
msgstr "I te taha poto, he tangata anō i ngana ki te whakarārangi i ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao: ko Aaron Swartz, te kaitōrangapū mamati kua mate, me te kaihanga-tahi o Reddit.<sup>3</sup> I <a %(youtube)s>tīmata ia i te Open Library</a> me te whāinga o te “kotahi whārangi tukutuku mō ia pukapuka kua whakaputaina”, mā te whakakotahi i ngā raraunga mai i ngā puna rerekē maha. I te mutunga, i utua e ia te utu nui rawa mō tana mahi tiaki mamati i te wā i whakawākia ia mō te tango papatipu i ngā pepa mātauranga, ā, i arahina ki tōna whakamomori. Kāore he kupu, koinei tētahi o ngā take i noho ai tō mātou rōpū hei ingoakē, ā, he tino tūpato mātou. Kei te whakahaere tonu te Open Library e ngā tāngata i te Internet Archive, e haere tonu ana i te taonga tuku iho a Aaron. Ka hoki mai mātou ki tēnei ā muri ake i tēnei pou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text4"
msgstr "I roto i te pou rangitaki a Google, ka whakamārama a Taycher i ētahi o ngā wero ki te whakatau tata i tēnei tau. Tuatahi, he aha te tikanga o te pukapuka? E toru pea ngā whakamāramatanga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.copies"
msgstr "<strong>Ngā kape ā-tinana.</strong> Mārama tonu kāore tēnei i te tino āwhina, i te mea he tārua noa iho ēnei o te rauemi kotahi. He rawe mēnā ka taea e mātou te tiaki i ngā tuhipoka katoa a te tangata i roto i ngā pukapuka, pērā i ngā “tuhipoka i ngā tapa” rongonui a Fermat. Engari, ka noho tonu tēnei hei moemoeā mō te kaitiaki kōrero."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.works"
msgstr "<strong>“Ngā Mahi”.</strong> Hei tauira, “Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets” hei ariā arorau, e kapi ana i ngā putanga katoa o taua pukapuka, pērā i ngā whakamaoritanga rerekē me ngā tānga anō. He whakamāramatanga whaihua tēnei, engari he uaua ki te whakatau i te rārangi o te mea ka whai wāhi. Hei tauira, tērā pea ka hiahia mātou ki te tiaki i ngā whakamaoritanga rerekē, ahakoa kāore pea ngā tānga anō me ngā rerekētanga iti i te mea nui."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.editions"
msgstr "<strong>“Ngā Putanga”.</strong> I konei ka tatau koe i ia putanga ahurei o te pukapuka. Mēnā he rerekē tētahi mea, pērā i te uhi rerekē, te kupu whakataki rerekē rānei, ka tatau hei putanga rerekē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.maybe.files"
msgstr "<strong>Ngā Kōnae.</strong> I te mahi me ngā whare pukapuka atarangi pērā i te Library Genesis, Sci-Hub, Z-Library rānei, he whakaaro anō. Ka taea te maha o ngā tārua o te putanga kotahi. Ā, ka taea e te tangata te hanga putanga pai ake o ngā kōnae e tū ana, mā te tārua i te kuputuhi mā te OCR, te whakatika rānei i ngā whārangi i tāruatia i te koki. E hiahia ana mātou ki te tatau i ēnei kōnae hei putanga kotahi, ka hiahia pea ki te metadata pai, te whakakore tārua rānei mā te ine ōrite tuhinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text5"
msgstr "Ko te “Ngā Putanga” te whakamāramatanga tino whaihua o te tikanga o te “pukapuka”. He waimarie, ka whakamahia hoki tēnei whakamāramatanga mō te tuku tau ISBN ahurei. Ko te ISBN, arā, te Tau Pukapuka Paerewa Ā-Ao, ka whakamahia whānuitia mō te hokohoko ā-ao, i te mea kua whakaurua ki te pūnaha waeherepae ā-ao (“International Article Number”). Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te hoko pukapuka i ngā toa, me whai waeherepae, nō reira ka whiwhi koe i te ISBN."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text6"
msgstr "E kī ana te pou rangitaki a Taycher ahakoa he whaihua ngā ISBN, kāore i te ao katoa, i te mea i te tīmatanga i te whāngaihia i te pokapū o ngā tau whitu tekau, ā, kāore i te ao katoa. Heoi anō, ko te ISBN pea te tohu e whakamahia whānuitia ana mō ngā putanga pukapuka, nō reira koinei te tīmatanga pai rawa mō mātou. Mēnā ka taea e mātou te kimi i ngā ISBN katoa o te ao, ka whiwhi mātou i tētahi rārangi whaihua o ngā pukapuka e hiahia ana kia tiakina."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text7"
msgstr "Nō reira, kei hea mātou e tiki ai i ngā raraunga? He maha ngā mahi e ngana ana ki te whakahiato i tētahi rārangi o ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.google"
msgstr "<strong>Google.</strong> I te mutunga, i mahia e rātou tēnei rangahau mō Google Books. Heoi anō, kāore e taea te uru papatipu ki ā rātou metadata, ā, he uaua ki te keri."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.openlib"
msgstr "<strong>Open Library.</strong> Ka rite ki te kī i mua, koinei tō rātou kaupapa katoa. Kua kohia e rātou ngā raraunga whare pukapuka nui mai i ngā whare pukapuka me ngā pūranga ā-motu e mahi tahi ana, ā, kei te haere tonu. Kei a rātou hoki ngā kaitiaki pukapuka tūao me tētahi rōpū hangarau e ngana ana ki te whakakore tārua i ngā rekoata, me te tohu i a rātou ki ngā momo metadata katoa. Ko te mea pai rawa, he tino tuwhera tō rātou huinga raraunga. Ka taea noa e koe te <a %(openlibrary)s>tikiake</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.worldcat"
msgstr "<strong>WorldCat.</strong> He paetukutuku tēnei e whakahaerehia ana e te OCLC kore-pānga, e hoko ana i ngā pūnaha whakahaere whare pukapuka. Ka whakahiato rātou i ngā metadata pukapuka mai i te maha o ngā whare pukapuka, ā, ka tuku i te wātea mā te paetukutuku WorldCat. Heoi anō, ka whiwhi moni hoki rātou mā te hoko i ēnei raraunga, nō reira kāore i te wātea mō te tikiake papatipu. Heoi anō, kei a rātou ētahi huinga raraunga papatipu iti ake e wātea ana mō te tikiake, i te mahi tahi me ētahi whare pukapuka motuhake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.isbndb"
msgstr "<strong>ISBNdb.</strong> Koinei te kaupapa o tēnei pou rangitaki. Ka keri a ISBNdb i ngā paetukutuku rerekē mō ngā metadata pukapuka, otirā ngā raraunga utu, ka hokona atu e rātou ki ngā kaihoko pukapuka, kia taea ai e rātou te utu i ā rātou pukapuka kia rite ki te toenga o te mākete. I te mea he tino ao whānui ngā ISBN i ēnei rā, kua hanga rātou i tētahi “whārangi tukutuku mō ia pukapuka”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.effort.ils"
msgstr "<strong>Ngā pūnaha whare pukapuka takitahi me ngā pūranga.</strong> He whare pukapuka me ngā pūranga kāore anō kia whakarārangitia, kia whakahiatotia rānei e tētahi o ngā mea i runga ake nei, i te nuinga o te wā nā te kore pūtea, nā ētahi atu take rānei kāore e hiahia ana ki te tuku i ā rātou raraunga ki te Open Library, OCLC, Google, me ērā atu. He maha o ēnei he rekoata mamati e wātea ana mā te ipurangi, ā, kāore i te tino tiakina, nō reira mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te āwhina me te whai wāhi ki te ako mō ngā pūnaha whare pukapuka rerekē, he tīmatanga pai ēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text8"
msgstr "I roto i tēnei pou, e koa ana mātou ki te pānui i tētahi tukunga iti (ka whakaritea ki ā mātou tukunga Z-Library o mua). I keri mātou i te nuinga o ISBNdb, ā, i tuku i ngā raraunga kia wātea mō te torohū i runga i te paetukutuku o te Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: kua neke ki <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Te Pūranga a Anna</a>; kāore mātou e hono tika atu ki konei, kimihia noa iho). E pā ana ēnei ki te 30.9 miriona rekoata (20GB hei <a %(jsonlines)s>Rārangi JSON</a>; 4.4GB kua kōpeke). I runga i tō rātou paetukutuku e kī ana rātou he 32.6 miriona rekoata tā rātou, nō reira tērā pea kua ngaro ētahi i a mātou, kei te mahi hē rānei <em>rātou</em>. Ahakoa pēhea, mō tēnei wā kāore mātou e whakaatu i te āhua i mahia ai e mātou — ka waiho tēnei hei mahi mā te kaipānui. ;-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text9"
msgstr "Ko te mea ka tohaina e mātou he ētahi tātaritanga tuatahi, kia tata atu ki te whakatau tata i te maha o ngā pukapuka o te ao. I tirohia e mātou e toru ngā huinga raraunga: tēnei huinga raraunga ISBNdb hou, tā mātou tukunga tuatahi o te metadata i keri mai i te whare pukapuka atarangi Z-Library (e kapi ana i te Library Genesis), me te putunga raraunga Open Library."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text10"
msgstr "Me tīmata ki ētahi tau tata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text11"
msgstr "I roto i te Z-Library/Libgen me te Open Library he maha atu ngā pukapuka i ngā ISBN ahurei. E tohu ana tēnei kāore he ISBN o te maha o aua pukapuka, kei te ngaro noa iho te metadata ISBN rānei? Tērā pea ka taea e mātou te whakautu i tēnei pātai mā te whakakotahi i te whakataurite aunoa i runga i ētahi atu āhuatanga (taitara, kaituhi, kaiwhakaputa, aha atu), te kukume mai i ētahi atu puna raraunga, me te tango ISBN mai i ngā tārua pukapuka ake (i te take o Z-Library/Libgen)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text12"
msgstr "E hia o aua ISBN he ahurei? Ka tino whakaatuhia tēnei ki tētahi hoahoa Venn:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text13"
msgstr "Kia mārama ake:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text14"
msgstr "I miharo mātou i te iti o te takirua! He nui te maha o ngā ISBN kei te ISBNdb kāore e kitea ana i te Z-Library, i te Open Library rānei, ā, he pērā anō (ahakoa he iti ake engari he nui tonu) mō ngā mea e rua atu. He maha ngā pātai hou ka ara ake i konei. Ka pēhea te āwhina o te tukutuku aunoa i te tohu i ngā pukapuka kāore i tohua ki ngā ISBN? Ka nui ngā takirua, ā, ka piki te takirua? Ā, ka aha mēnā ka kawea mai he huinga raraunga tuawhā, tuarima rānei? Ka pēhea te nui o te takirua ka kitea i reira?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text15"
msgstr "Ka tuku tēnei i tētahi tīmatanga mā mātou. Ka taea ināianei te titiro ki ngā ISBN katoa kāore i roto i te huinga raraunga Z-Library, ā, kāore hoki e ōrite ana ki ngā mara taitara/kaituhi. Ka taea e tēnei te āwhina i a mātou ki te tiaki i ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao: tuatahi mā te keri i te ipurangi mō ngā karapa, kātahi ka puta ki te ao tūturu ki te karapa pukapuka. Ka taea anō te pūtea ā-pūtea, te ārahi rānei e ngā \"utu\" mai i ngā tāngata e hiahia ana ki te kite i ētahi pukapuka motuhake kua rorohikatia. Ko tēnei katoa he kōrero mō tētahi wā kē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text16"
msgstr "Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te āwhina i tēnei — te tātaritanga anō; te keri metadata anō; te kimi pukapuka anō; te OCR i ngā pukapuka; te mahi i tēnei mō ētahi atu wāhanga (hei tauira, ngā pepa, ngā pukapuka oro, ngā kiriata, ngā whakaaturanga pouaka whakaata, ngā maheni) ahakoa te tuku i ētahi o ēnei raraunga mō ngā mea pērā i te ML / te whakangungu tauira reo nui — tēnā whakapā mai ki ahau (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text17"
msgstr "Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te tātaritanga raraunga, kei te mahi mātou ki te tuku i ā mātou huinga raraunga me ngā tuhinga ki tētahi hōputu māmā ake ki te whakamahi. He rawe mēnā ka taea e koe te kape i tētahi pukapuka tuhipoka, ka tīmata ki te tākaro ki tēnei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.text18"
msgstr "Hei whakamutunga, mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te tautoko i tēnei mahi, tēnā whakaarohia te tuku koha. He whakahaere tūao katoa tēnei, ā, he nui tō koha. He āwhina nui ia wāhanga. I tēnei wā ka tango mātou i ngā koha i roto i te moni matihiko; tirohia te whārangi Koha i te Pūranga a Anna."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn1"
msgstr "1. Mō tētahi whakamāramatanga whaitake o te \"tonu\". ;)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn2"
msgstr "2. Ko te tikanga, he nui ake te taonga tuhituhi a te tangata i ngā pukapuka, ina koa i ēnei rā. Mō te take o tēnei pou me ā mātou whakaputanga tata nei kei te arotahi mātou ki ngā pukapuka, engari ka toro atu ā mātou hiahia."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.isbndb-dump.fn3"
msgstr "3. He nui atu ngā kōrero ka taea te kī mō Aaron Swartz, engari i hiahia noa mātou ki te whakahua i a ia i te poto, i te mea he wāhanga matua ia i tēnei kōrero. Ka haere te wā, ka nui ake ngā tāngata ka tūtaki tuatahi ki tōna ingoa, ā, ka taea e rātou te ruku ki te rua kiore."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.title"
msgstr "Te matapihi whakahirahira o ngā whare pukapuka atarangi"

#, fuzzy
