msgstr "<a %(critical_window_chinese)s>Putanga Hainamana 中文版</a>, kōrerohia i runga <a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.text1"
msgstr "I te Pūranga a Anna, he maha ngā pātai ka pātaihia ki a mātou me pēhea e taea ai e mātou te kī ka tiakina ā mātou kohinga mō ake tonu atu, i te mea kei te tata kē te rahi katoa ki te 1 Petabyte (1000 TB), ā, kei te tipu tonu. I roto i tēnei tuhinga ka titiro mātou ki tō mātou kaupapa, ā, ka kite he aha te tekau tau e whai ake nei he mea nui mō tō mātou kaupapa ki te tiaki i te mātauranga me te ahurea o te tangata."

#, fuzzy
