#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text3"
msgstr "Ko te whakarārangitanga i tēnei rārangi he āhua matapōkere — he maha ngā tūemi he ōrite, he tautohetohe rānei kei roto i tō mātou tīma — ā, tērā pea kei te wareware mātou i ētahi kāwai hira. Engari koinei te āhua o tā mātou whakaarotau."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text4"
msgstr "Ko ētahi o ēnei tūemi he tino rerekē i ērā atu kia āwangawanga mātou (kua oti kē rānei i ētahi atu whakahaere), pērā i te raraunga koiora, raraunga matawhenua rānei. Engari ko te nuinga o ngā tūemi i tēnei rārangi he tino hira ki a mātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text5"
msgstr "Ko tētahi atu āhuatanga nui i roto i tā mātou whakaarotau ko te mōrea o tētahi mahi. Ka pai ake ki a mātou te arotahi ki ngā mahi e:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.rare"
msgstr "Uaua"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.underfocused"
msgstr "He tino kore aro"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.at-risk"
msgstr "He tino mōrea ki te whakangaromanga (hei tauira, nā te pakanga, te whakaiti pūtea, ngā whakawakanga, te whakatoihara tōrangapū rānei)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text6"
msgstr "Hei whakamutunga, ka aro mātou ki te rahi. He iti te wā me te pūtea kei a mātou, nō reira ka pai ake ki a mātou te whakapau i te marama ki te whakaora i te 10,000 pukapuka i te 1,000 pukapuka — mēnā he ōrite te uara me te mōrea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Ngā whare pukapuka atarangi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "He maha ngā whakahaere e whai ana i ngā whāinga ōrite, me ngā whakaarotau ōrite. Inā hoki, he whare pukapuka, he whare pūranga, he taiwhanga, he whare taonga, me ētahi atu whakahaere kua whakatūria hei tiaki i tēnei momo. He maha o ēnei e whiwhi ana i te pūtea nui, nā ngā kāwanatanga, ngā tāngata takitahi, ngā umanga rānei. Engari he koretake nui tō rātou: te pūnaha ture."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Kei konei te tūranga ahurei o ngā whare pukapuka atarangi, me te take i tū ai te Pūranga a Anna. Ka taea e mātou te mahi i ngā mea kāore e whakaaetia ana e ētahi atu whakahaere. Inaianei, ehara i te mea (i te nuinga o te wā) ka taea e mātou te pūranga i ngā rauemi e koretake ana ki te tiaki i ētahi atu wāhi. Kāo, he ture i ngā wāhi maha ki te hanga pūranga me ngā pukapuka, pepa, māheni, aha atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Engari ko te mea e kore e whai wāhi ana ngā pūranga ture ko te <strong>whakawhitinga me te roa o te ora</strong>. Kei reira ngā pukapuka e kotahi noa te kape kei roto i tētahi whare pukapuka ā-tinana i tētahi wāhi. Kei reira ngā rekoata metadata e tiakina ana e tētahi kamupene kotahi. Kei reira ngā niupepa e tiakina ana i runga i te microfilm i tētahi pūranga kotahi. Ka taea e ngā whare pukapuka te tapahia te pūtea, ka taea e ngā kamupene te whakakore, ka taea e ngā pūranga te pahū me te tahuna ki te whenua. Ehara tēnei i te whakapae noa — ka tupu tēnei i ngā wā katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Ko te mea ka taea e mātou i te Pūpū Pukapuka a Anna ko te rokiroki i ngā kape maha o ngā mahi, i te rahi. Ka taea e mātou te kohikohi pepa, pukapuka, maheni, me ētahi atu, me te tohatoha i a rātou i te rahinga nui. Kei te mahi mātou i tēnei i tēnei wā mā te whakamahi i ngā torrents, engari kāore e whai tikanga te hangarau ake, ā, ka huri haere i te wā. Ko te mea nui ko te whiwhi i ngā kape maha kua tohatoha huri noa i te ao. Ko tēnei kōrero mai i te 200 tau ki muri e tika tonu ana:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Ko te mea kua ngaro kāore e taea te whakahoki mai; engari me tiaki e tatou te toenga: ehara i te mea mā ngā rūma me ngā kī e aukati ana i a rātou i te tirohanga me te whakamahi a te marea, i te tuku i a rātou ki te moumou o te wā, engari mā te tini o ngā kape, ka waiho rātou ki tua atu i te whāinga o te aituā.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "He tuhipoka tere mō te rohe tūmatanui. Nā te mea e arotahi ana te Pūpū Pukapuka a Anna ki ngā mahi e hara ana i te ture i ngā wāhi maha o te ao, kāore mātou e aro ki ngā kohinga e wātea ana, pērā i ngā pukapuka rohe tūmatanui. He maha ngā rōpū ture kua tiaki pai kē i tērā. Heoi, he whakaaro e āhei ana mātou ki te mahi i ngā kohinga e wātea ana ki te marea i ētahi wā:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Ka taea te mātakitaki noa i ngā rekoata metadata i runga i te paetukutuku Worldcat, engari kāore e taea te tikiake i te rahinga nui (kia tae ra ano ki te wā i <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>tātaritia</a> e mātou)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Ka taea te waehere te tuwhera i runga i Github, engari kāore e taea te whakaata ngā Github katoa, ā, kāore e taea te tiaki (ahakoa i tēnei wā he nui ngā kape kua tohatoha o te nuinga o ngā putunga waehere)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "He kore utu te whakamahi i Reddit, engari i tata nei kua whakatakotoria e rātou ngā tikanga aukati tātaritanga kaha, i te aranga ake o te whakangungu LLM e hiakai ana ki te raraunga (he kōrero anō mō tērā ā muri ake nei)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "He tini o ngā kape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Hoki atu ki tā mātou pātai taketake: me pēhea e taea ai e mātou te kī ka tiakina e mātou ā mātou kohinga mō ake tonu atu? Ko te raru matua i konei ko te tipu haere o tā mātou kohinga <a %(torrents_stats)s>e tere ana te tipu</a>, mā te tātaritanga me te tuwhera i ētahi kohinga nui (i runga ake i te mahi whakamīharo kua oti kē e ētahi atu whare pukapuka raraunga tuwhera pērā i Sci-Hub me Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Ko tēnei tipu o te raraunga ka uaua ake te whakaata i ngā kohinga huri noa i te ao. He utu nui te rokiroki raraunga! Engari e manako ana mātou, ina koa i te mātakitaki i ngā ahunga e toru e whai ake nei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Kua kohia e mātou ngā hua e tata ana"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Ka whai tēnei i ngā kaupapa matua i kōrerohia i runga ake nei. Ka pai ake mātou ki te mahi i te whakarangatira i ngā kohinga nui i te tuatahi. Inaianei kua mau i a mātou ētahi o ngā kohinga nui rawa atu o te ao, e tūmanako ana mātou ka puhoi ake te tipu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "He roa tonu te hiku o ngā kohinga iti, ā, ia rā ka tāia, ka whakaputaina rānei ngā pukapuka hou, engari ka puhoi ake te tere. Ka taea pea e mātou te rua, te toru rānei te rahi, engari i roto i te wā roa ake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Kei te heke haere tonu ngā utu rokiroki"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "I te wā o te tuhinga, ko ngā <a %(diskprices)s>utu kōpae</a> ia TB kei te $12 mō ngā kōpae hou, $8 mō ngā kōpae kua whakamahia, ā, $4 mō te rīpene. Mēnā he tūpato mātou, ā, ka titiro noa ki ngā kōpae hou, ko te tikanga ko te rokiroki i te petabyte ka utu tata ki te $12,000. Mēnā ka whakaarohia ka toru te rahi o tā mātou whare pukapuka mai i te 900TB ki te 2.7PB, ka tohu tēnei i te $32,400 ki te whakaata i tā mātou whare pukapuka katoa. Ka tāpiri i te hiko, te utu o ētahi atu taputapu, me ētahi atu, me whakakapi ki te $40,000. Ki te rīpene, he $15,000–$20,000 pea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "I tētahi taha <strong>he $15,000–$40,000 mō te katoa o te mātauranga tangata he tino utu iti</strong>. I tētahi atu taha, he paku teitei te tūmanako kia maha ngā kape katoa, ina koa mēnā ka hiahia hoki mātou ki te pupuri i a rātou ki te tuku i ā rātou torrents mō te painga o ētahi atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Ko tēnei te rā o nāianei. Engari kei te anga whakamua te ahunga whakamua:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Kua tata te tapahia ngā utu kōpae mārō ia TB ki te hautoru i roto i ngā tau 10 kua hipa, ā, ka heke tonu pea i te tere ōrite. Kei te whai te rīpene i te ahunga ōrite. Kei te heke tere ake ngā utu SSD, ā, ka taea pea te utu HDD i te mutunga o te tekau tau."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Ngā ahunga utu HDD mai i ngā puna rerekē (pāwhiri ki te tiro i te rangahau)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Mēnā ka mau tēnei, i roto i te 10 tau ka taea pea e mātou te titiro ki te $5,000–$13,000 noa iho ki te whakaata i tā mātou kohinga katoa (1/3), he iti ake rānei mēnā ka iti ake te tipu. Ahakoa he nui tonu te moni, ka taea tēnei e te maha o te tangata. Ā, ka pai ake pea nā te mea o te wāhi e whai ake nei…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Ngā whakapainga i te kiato mōhiohio"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "I tēnei wā, ka rokiroki mātou i ngā pukapuka i roto i ngā hōputu taketake i tukua mai ki a mātou. Āe, kua kōpekehia, engari he nui tonu ngā karapa, ngā whakaahua rānei o ngā whārangi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Ā mohoa noa nei, ko ngā kōwhiringa anake hei whakaiti i te rahi katoa o tā mātou kohinga, ko te kōpeketanga kaha ake, te whakakore tārua rānei. Heoi, ki te whiwhi penapena nui, he nui rawa te ngaronga o te kounga mō tā mātou i pai ai. Mā te kōpeketanga taumaha o ngā whakaahua ka uaua te pānui i te kuputuhi. Ā, ko te whakakore tārua me tino mōhio he ōrite ngā pukapuka, he tino hē tonu tēnei, ina koa mēnā he ōrite ngā ihirangi engari i karapahia i ngā wā rerekē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Kua noho mai he kōwhiringa tuatoru, engari he tino koretake te kounga i kore ai mātou i whakaaro ki taua kōwhiringa: <strong>OCR, arā, Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Koinei te tukanga o te huri whakaahua ki te kuputuhi māori, mā te whakamahi i te AI ki te kite i ngā pūāhua i roto i ngā whakaahua. Kua roa ngā taputapu mō tēnei e noho ana, ā, he pai tonu, engari kāore te \"pai tonu\" i te rawaka mō ngā kaupapa tiaki."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Heoi, kua tere te ahu whakamua o ngā tauira ako hōhonu maha-arotahi, ahakoa he nui tonu ngā utu. E tūmanako ana mātou ka tino pai ake te tika me ngā utu i ngā tau e heke mai nei, kia taea ai te whakamahi ki tō mātou whare pukapuka katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Ngā whakapainga OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Ka tae ana ki taua wā, ka tiakina tonutia pea e mātou ngā kōnae taketake, engari ka taea hoki e mātou te whai i tētahi putanga iti ake o tō mātou whare pukapuka e hiahia ana te nuinga o te tangata ki te tārua. Ko te mea nui, ka pai ake te kōpeketanga o te kuputuhi māori, ā, he māmā ake te whakakore tārua, ka nui ake ngā penapena mō mātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "I te katoa, kāore i te koretake te tūmanako kia iti iho te rahi o ngā kōnae katoa mā te 5-10x, ā, pea he nui ake. Ahakoa he 5x te whakaiti, ka titiro mātou ki te <strong>$1,000–$3,000 i roto i te 10 tau ahakoa ka toru ngā rahi o tō mātou whare pukapuka</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Matapihi hira"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Mēnā he tika ēnei matapae, me <strong>tatari noa mātou mō ngā tau e rua</strong> ka tāruatia whānuitia tō mātou kohinga katoa. Nā reira, i ngā kupu a Thomas Jefferson, “ka waiho ki tua atu i te whāwhai a te aituā.”"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Aroha mai, kua whakatūria e te putanga o ngā LLM, me tō rātou hiahia nui ki te raraunga, he maha ngā kaipupuri mana pupuri ki te ārai. Neke atu i te mea i mua. He maha ngā paetukutuku e uaua ana te keri raraunga me te rokiroki, e rere ana ngā whakawa, ā, i te wā kotahi ka noho tonu ngā whare pukapuka ā-tinana me ngā pūranga ki te warewaretia."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Ka taea anake te tūmanako ka kino haere ēnei ia, ā, ka ngaro te maha o ngā mahi i mua i te urunga ki te marea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Kei te ahiahi mātou o tētahi hurihanga i te tiaki, engari <q>kāore e taea te whakahoki mai te ngaro.</q></strong> Kei a mātou he matapihi hira o te 5-10 tau i te wā e utu nui tonu ana te whakahaere i tētahi whare pukapuka huna me te hanga i ngā tārua maha huri noa i te ao, ā, i te wā kāore anō kia tino aukatihia te uru."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Mēnā ka taea e mātou te whakawhiti i tēnei matapihi, ka tino tiakina e mātou te mātauranga me te ahurea o te tangata mō ake tonu atu. Kaua e tukua tēnei wā kia moumou. Kaua e tukua tēnei matapihi hira kia kati ki runga i a mātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "Kia kaha tātou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Uru motuhake mō ngā kamupene LLM ki te kohinga pukapuka kore-paki Hainamana nui rawa atu i te ao"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Putanga Hainamana 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Matapaki i runga i te Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Kua riro i te Pūranga a Anna tētahi kohinga ahurei o ngā pukapuka kore-paki Hainamana 7.5 miriona / 350TB — he nui ake i te Library Genesis. Kei te hiahia mātou ki te tuku uru motuhake ki tētahi kamupene LLM, hei utu mō te OCR kounga teitei me te tango kuputuhi.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "He pou rangitaki poto tēnei. Kei te rapu mātou i tētahi kamupene, whakahaere rānei hei āwhina i a mātou ki te OCR me te tango kuputuhi mō tētahi kohinga nui i riro mai i a mātou, hei utu mō te uru motuhake wawe. I muri i te wā aukati, ka tukuna e mātou te kohinga katoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "He tino whaihua te tuhinga mātauranga kounga teitei mō te whakangungu i ngā LLM. Ahakoa he Hainamana tā mātou kohinga, ka whai hua tonu tēnei mō te whakangungu i ngā LLM reo Ingarihi: te āhua nei ka whakamāori ngā tauira i ngā ariā me te mātauranga ahakoa te reo taketake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Hei tēnei, me tango te tuhinga i ngā karapa. He aha te hua ki a Anna’s Archive? Te rapu tuhinga-katoa o ngā pukapuka mō ōna kaiwhakamahi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Nā te mea e hāngai ana ā mātou whāinga ki ērā o ngā kaiwhakawhanake LLM, kei te rapu mātou i tētahi hoa mahi. Kei te hiahia mātou ki te tuku <strong>urunga motuhake wawe ki tēnei kohinga i te rahi mō te 1 tau</strong>, mēnā ka taea e koe te mahi tika i te OCR me te tango tuhinga. Mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te tohatoha i te waehere katoa o tō paipa ki a mātou, ka pai mātou ki te aukati i te kohinga mō te wā roa ake."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Ngā whārangi tauira"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Hei whakaatu mai ki a mātou he pai tō paipa, anei ētahi whārangi tauira hei tīmata, mai i tētahi pukapuka mō ngā superconductors. Me tika tō paipa ki te whakahaere i te pāngarau, ngā ripanga, ngā tūtohi, ngā tuhipoka, me ērā atu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Tukua mai ō whārangi kua oti te tukatuka ki tā mātou īmēra. Mēnā he pai te āhua, ka tuku atu anō mātou ki a koe i roto i te tūmataiti, ā, e tūmanako ana mātou ka taea e koe te whakahaere tere i tō paipa ki aua mea anō. Kia makona mātou, ka taea te whakaae."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Kohinga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Ētahi atu pārongo mō te kohinga. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> he pātengi raraunga nui o ngā pukapuka kua karapahia, i hangaia e te <a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Ko te nuinga he pukapuka mātauranga, i karapahia kia wātea ai ki ngā whare wānanga me ngā whare pukapuka. Mō tō mātou hunga whakarongo reo Ingarihi, he pai ngā tirohanga whānui a <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> me te <a %(guides_lib_uw)s>University of Washington</a>. He tuhinga pai hoki e tuku ana i ētahi atu kōrero: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (kimihia i Anna’s Archive)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Kua roa ngā pukapuka mai i Duxiu e tāhaetia ana i runga i te ipurangi Hainamana. I te nuinga o te wā ka hokona mō te iti iho i te tāra e ngā kaihoko. Ka tohaina i te nuinga o te wā mā te ōrite Hainamana o Google Drive, kua tūkinotia i te nuinga o te wā kia nui ake te mokowā rokiroki. Ka kitea ētahi kōrero hangarau <a %(github_duty_machine)s>i konei</a> me <a %(github_821_github_io)s>i konei</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Ahakoa kua tohaina whānuitia ngā pukapuka, he uaua tonu te tiki i a rātou i te rahi. I teitei tēnei i runga i tā mātou rārangi TODO, ā, i whakatāpaea ētahi marama maha o te mahi wā-katoa mō tēnei. Heoi anō, i tata nei ka tae mai tētahi kaitūao whakamīharo, mīharo, me te pūmanawa ki a mātou, e kī ana kua oti kē i a rātou tēnei mahi katoa — i te utu nui. I tohaina e rātou te kohinga katoa ki a mātou, me te kore e tūmanako i tētahi utu, engari ko te kī taurangi o te tiaki wā roa. He tino whakamīharo. I whakaae rātou ki te tono āwhina i tēnei ara ki te tiki i te kohinga kia OCR'ed."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Ko te kohinga he 7,543,702 kōnae. He nui ake tēnei i te Library Genesis non-fiction (tata ki te 5.3 miriona). Ko te rahi katoa o te kōnae he 359TB (326TiB) i tōna āhua o nāianei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Kei te tuwhera mātou ki ētahi atu tono me ngā whakaaro. Whakapā mai ki a mātou. Tirohia a Anna’s Archive mō ētahi atu pārongo mō ā mātou kohinga, ngā mahi tiaki, me pēhea tō āwhina. Ngā mihi!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Whakatūpato: kua whakakorea tēnei pou rangitaki. Kua whakatauhia e mātou kāore anō te IPFS kia rite mō te wā nui. Ka hono tonu mātou ki ngā kōnae i runga i te IPFS mai i Anna’s Archive mēnā ka taea, engari kāore mātou e manaaki i a ia anō, kāore hoki mātou e tūtohu i ētahi atu ki te whakaata mā te IPFS. Tēnā tirohia tā mātou whārangi Torrents mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te āwhina ki te tiaki i tā mātou kohinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Āwhina ki te whakatō i te Z-Library i runga i te IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Me pēhea te whakahaere i tētahi whare pukapuka atarangi: ngā mahi i Anna’s Archive"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Kāore he <q>AWS mō ngā atawhai atarangi,</q> nā reira me pēhea te whakahaere i Anna’s Archive?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Kei te whakahaere ahau i <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, te pūnaha rapu kore-pānga nui rawa atu o te ao mō ngā <a %(wikipedia_shadow_library)s>whare pukapuka atarangi</a>, pērā i a Sci-Hub, Library Genesis, me Z-Library. Ko tā mātou whāinga he tuku mātauranga me te ahurea kia wātea, ā, i te mutunga, ki te hanga i tētahi hapori o te hunga e kohikohi ana, e tiaki ana i <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>ngā pukapuka katoa o te ao</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "I roto i tēnei tuhinga ka whakaatu ahau me pēhea te whakahaere i tēnei paetukutuku, me ngā wero ahurei e pā ana ki te whakahaere i tētahi paetukutuku me te tūnga ture pātai, nā te mea kāore he “AWS mō ngā atawhai atarangi”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Tirohia hoki te tuhinga tuahine <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Me pēhea te noho hei kaitiaki tāhae</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Ngā tohu auaha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "Me tīmata tātou ki tō mātou hanganga hangarau. He mea āta hanga kia noho hōhā. Ka whakamahi mātou i te Flask, MariaDB, me ElasticSearch. Koira anake. Kua tino oti te rapu, ā, kāore mātou e hiahia ki te waihanga anō. I tua atu, me whakapau mātou i ā mātou <a %(mcfunley)s>tohu auaha</a> ki tētahi atu mea: kia kaua e whakakorea e ngā mana whakahaere."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Nā, he aha te āhua ture, kore ture rānei o te Pūranga a Anna? Ka whakawhirinaki tēnei ki te mana ture. Ko te nuinga o ngā whenua e whakapono ana ki tētahi momo manatārua, arā, ka whakawhiwhia ngā tāngata, ngā kamupene rānei ki tētahi mana motuhake mō ētahi momo mahi mō tētahi wā. Hei kōrero tāpiri, i te Pūranga a Anna e whakapono ana mātou ahakoa he painga kei reira, ko te manatārua he kino mō te hapori — engari he kōrero anō tēnei mō tētahi wā kē."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Ko tēnei mana motuhake mō ētahi mahi e kī ana he turekore mō te hunga kei waho o tēnei mana motuhake te tohatoha tika i aua mahi — tae atu ki a mātou. Engari he pūnaha rapu te Pūranga a Anna kāore e tohatoha tika i aua mahi (i te iti rawa i runga i tō mātou paetukutuku clearnet), nō reira me pai mātou, nē? Kāore rawa. I roto i ngā mana ture maha, ehara i te mea he turekore noa te tohatoha i ngā mahi manatārua, engari anō hoki te hono ki ngā wāhi e mahi ana. Ko tētahi tauira rongonui o tēnei ko te ture DMCA o Amerika."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Koinei te pito tino kaha o te whānuitanga. I te pito atu o te whānuitanga, ka taea pea te noho o ngā whenua kāore he ture manatārua, engari kāore ēnei e tino tū. Tata ki ia whenua he momo ture manatārua kei runga i ngā pukapuka. He kōrero kē te whakatinana. He maha ngā whenua kāore ngā kāwanatanga e aro ki te whakatinana i te ture manatārua. He whenua anō kei waenganui i ngā pito e rua, e aukati ana i te tohatoha i ngā mahi manatārua, engari kāore e aukati i te hono ki aua mahi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Ko tētahi atu whakaaro ko te taumata-kamupene. Mēnā he kamupene kei te whakahaere i tētahi mana ture kāore e aro ki te manatārua, engari kāore te kamupene ake e hiahia ki te tango i tētahi mōrearea, ka taea pea e rātou te kati i tō paetukutuku i te wā ka amuamu tētahi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Hei whakamutunga, ko tētahi whakaaro nui ko ngā utu. I te mea me noho mātou i te tūmataiti, kāore e taea te whakamahi i ngā tikanga utu tuku iho. Ka waiho tēnei ki a mātou ngā moni mariko, ā, he iti noa ngā kamupene e tautoko ana i ēnei (he kāri nama mariko e utua ana e te moni mariko, engari he maha kāore e whakaaetia)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Hanganga pūnaha"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Nā, me kī kua kitea e koe ētahi kamupene e pai ana ki te manaaki i tō paetukutuku me te kore e kati i a koe — me kī ēnei he “kaiwhakarato aroha ki te herekore” 😄. Ka kite wawe koe he utu nui te manaaki i ngā mea katoa ki a rātou, nō reira ka hiahia pea koe ki te kimi i ētahi “kaiwhakarato iti” me te manaaki i te wāhi tūturu ki reira, mā te whakawhiti i ngā kaiwhakarato aroha ki te herekore. Mēnā ka tika tō mahi, kāore ngā kaiwhakarato iti e mōhio he aha te mea e manaaki ana koe, ā, kāore e whiwhi amuamu."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Me ngā kaiwhakarato katoa nei he mōrearea ka kati tonu rātou i a koe, nō reira me whai anō koe i te tāruatanga. Me whai tēnei i ngā taumata katoa o tō mātou hanganga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Ko tētahi kamupene e paku aroha ana ki te herekore kua tū ki tētahi tūranga whakamīharo ko Cloudflare. Kua <a %(blog_cloudflare)s>tohe</a> rātou kāore rātou he kaiwhakarato manaaki, engari he taputapu, pērā i te ISP. Nō reira kāore rātou e pāngia ana e te DMCA, i ētahi atu tono whakakore rānei, ā, ka tuku i ngā tono ki tō kaiwhakarato manaaki tūturu. Kua tae rātou ki te haere ki te kōti ki te tiaki i tēnei hanganga. Nō reira ka taea e mātou te whakamahi i a rātou hei tētahi atu papa o te keteroki me te tiaki."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "Kāore a Cloudflare e whakaae ana ki ngā utu tūmataiti, nō reira ka taea anake te whakamahi i tā rātou mahere kore utu. Ko te tikanga kāore e taea te whakamahi i ā rātou āhuatanga toha kawenga, whakakapi rānei. Nō reira <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>i whakatinana mātou i tēnei</a> i te taumata rohe. I te utaina o te whārangi, ka tirohia e te pūtirotiro mēnā kei te wātea tonu te rohe o nāianei, ā, ki te kore, ka tuhi anō i ngā URL katoa ki tētahi atu rohe. I te mea ka keteroki a Cloudflare i ngā whārangi maha, ko te tikanga ka taea e te kaiwhakamahi te tau ki runga i tō mātou rohe matua, ahakoa kua hinga te tūmau takawaenga, ā, i te pāwhiri o muri mai ka nekehia ki tētahi atu rohe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Kei te noho tonu hoki mātou ki ngā āwangawanga whakahaere noa, pērā i te aroturuki i te hauora o te tūmau, te takiuru i ngā hapa o muri me mua, me ērā atu. Ka taea e tō mātou hanganga whakakapi te tuku i te pakari ake i tēnei taha anō hoki, hei tauira mā te whakahaere i tētahi huinga tūmau rerekē i runga i tētahi o ngā rohe. Ka taea anō e mātou te whakahaere i ngā putanga tawhito o te waehere me ngā Datasets i runga i tēnei rohe motuhake, mēnā ka kore e kitea tētahi hapa nui i te putanga matua."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Ka taea hoki e mātou te aukati i te huri a Cloudflare ki a mātou, mā te tango i a ia i tētahi o ngā rohe, pērā i tēnei rohe motuhake. He maha ngā rerekētanga o ēnei whakaaro ka taea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Ngā taputapu"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "Me titiro ki ngā taputapu e whakamahia ana e mātou ki te whakatutuki i ēnei mea katoa. Kei te tino whanake tēnei i a mātou e pā ana ki ngā raruraru hou, e kimi ana i ngā rongoā hou."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Tūmau taupānga: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Tūmau takawaenga: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Whakahaere tūmau: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Whanaketanga: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Te tūnga pūmau o Onion: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "He maha ngā whakatau kua hoki whakamuri, kua hoki whakamua mātou. Ko tētahi ko te whakawhitiwhiti kōrero i waenga i ngā tūmau: i whakamahia e mātou te Wireguard mō tēnei, engari i kitea e mātou i ētahi wā ka mutu te tuku raraunga, ka tuku rānei i te raraunga i tētahi huarahi anake. I pērā tēnei i ngā whakaritenga Wireguard rerekē i whakamātauhia e mātou, pērā i te <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> me te <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. I whakamātau hoki mātou ki te kōhao i ngā tauranga mā te SSH, mā te whakamahi i te autossh me te sshuttle, engari i pāngia e mātou ngā <a %(github_sshuttle)s>raruraru i reira</a> (ahakoa kāore i te mārama ki ahau mēnā ka pāngia te autossh e ngā take TCP-over-TCP, kāo rānei — he āhua rerekē noa iho ki ahau engari tērā pea he pai tonu?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Engari, i hoki mātou ki ngā hononga tika i waenga i ngā tūmau, ka huna i te tūmau e rere ana i runga i ngā kaiwhakarato iti mā te tātari-IP me te UFW. Ko te raru o tēnei ko te kore pai o Docker ki te mahi me te UFW, mēnā kāore koe e whakamahi i te <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. He āhua mōrearea ake tēnei katoa, nā te mea ka whakatuwhera koe i tō tūmau ki te ipurangi me te hapa iti noa iho. Tērā pea me hoki mātou ki te autossh — ka tino manakohia ngā urupare i konei."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Kua hoki whakamuri, whakamua hoki mātou i runga i te Varnish me te Nginx. I tēnei wā, e pai ana mātou ki te Varnish, engari he āhua rerekē ōna āhuatanga. Ka pērā anō ki te Checkmk: kāore mātou e aroha ana ki a ia, engari e pai ana mō tēnei wā. He pai noa iho te Weblate engari kāore i te tino pai — i ētahi wā ka mataku ahau ka ngaro aku raraunga i ngā wā e ngana ana ahau ki te whakakotahi i a ia ki tā mātou git repo. He pai te Flask i te nuinga o te wā, engari he āhua rerekē ōna āhuatanga i pau ai te wā ki te whakatika, pērā i te whirihora i ngā rohe ritenga, i ngā take rānei me te hononga SqlAlchemy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "I tēnei wā, he pai ngā taputapu kē atu: kāore he amuamu nui mō MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, me Tor. Kua pāngia ēnei katoa e ētahi take, engari kāore he mea tino nui, he mea kaiwā hoki."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
msgstr "Whakamutunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "He wheako whakamere te ako ki te whakatū i tētahi pūnaha rapu whare pukapuka marumaru pakari, manawaroa hoki. He maha tonu ngā taipitopito hei tuari i ngā pou e whai ake nei, nā reira whakamōhio mai he aha ngā mea e hiahia ana koe ki te ako atu!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Pērā i ngā wā katoa, e rapu ana mātou i ngā takoha hei tautoko i tēnei mahi, nā reira kia mātua tirohia te whārangi Takoha i te Pūranga a Anna. Kei te rapu hoki mātou i ētahi atu momo tautoko, pērā i ngā karahipi, ngā kaitautoko wā roa, ngā kaiwhakarato utu mōrearea, tērā pea he pānui (he ātaahua!). Ā, mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te tuku i tō wā me ō pūkenga, kei te rapu tonu mātou i ngā kaiwhakawhanake, ngā kaiwhakamāori, me ērā atu. Ngā mihi mō tō hiahia me tō tautoko."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.signature"
msgstr "- Anna me te rōpū (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
