msgstr "Kia ora, ko Anna ahau. Nāku i hanga te <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Pūranga a Anna</a>, te whare pukapuka marumaru nui rawa o te ao. Ko tēnei taku rangitaki whaiaro, kei konei au me aku hoa mahi e tuhi ana mō te tāhae, te tiaki matihiko, me ētahi atu kaupapa."

#, fuzzy
