#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.index.heading"
msgstr "Ngā pou rangitaki"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.title"
msgstr "1.3B WorldCat keri raraunga"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Te whakatakoto i ngā pukapuka 5,998,794 ki runga IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Whakatūpato: kua whakakorea tēnei pou rangitaki. Kua whakatauhia e mātou kāore anō te IPFS kia rite mō te wā nui. Ka hono tonu mātou ki ngā kōnae i runga i te IPFS mai i Anna’s Archive mēnā ka taea, engari kāore mātou e manaaki i a ia anō, kāore hoki mātou e tūtohu i ētahi atu ki te whakaata mā te IPFS. Tēnā tirohia tā mātou whārangi Torrents mēnā kei te hiahia koe ki te āwhina ki te tiaki i tā mātou kohinga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Kua keri te Pūranga a Anna i te katoa o WorldCat (te kohinga metadata whare pukapuka nui rawa o te ao) hei hanga i tētahi rārangi TODO o ngā pukapuka e tika ana kia tiakina.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "I tētahi tau ki muri, i <a %(blog)s>whakatakoto mātou</a> i tēnei pātai: <strong>He aha te ōrau o ngā pukapuka kua tiakina pūmau e ngā whare pukapuka marumaru?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Kia uru ana tētahi pukapuka ki tētahi whare pukapuka marumaru raraunga tuwhera pērā i te <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, ā, ināianei te <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Pūranga a Anna</a>, ka whakaatahia puta noa i te ao (mā ngā torohū), nā reira ka tiakina pūmau."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Hei whakautu i te pātai mō te ōrau o ngā pukapuka kua tiakina, me mōhio mātou ki te taupū: e hia katoa ngā pukapuka e tū ana? Ā, me te pai hoki mēnā kāore he tau anake, engari he metadata tūturu. Ka taea e mātou te whakataurite i ēnei ki ngā whare pukapuka marumaru, engari anō hoki <strong>te hanga i tētahi rārangi TODO o ngā pukapuka e toe ana hei tiaki!</strong> Ka taea anō te tīmata ki te moemoeā mō tētahi kaupapa mahi tahi ki te heke i tēnei rārangi TODO."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "I tāmiro mātou i te <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, ā, i tikiake i te <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, engari kāore i tino pai ngā hua. Ko te raru matua ko te iti o te hononga o ngā ISBN. Tirohia tēnei hoahoa Venn mai i <a %(blog)s>tā mātou tuhinga rangitaki</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "I tino ohorere mātou i te iti o te hononga i waenga i te ISBNdb me te Open Library, e rua e whakauru ana i ngā raraunga mai i ngā puna rerekē, pērā i ngā tāmiro tukutuku me ngā rekoata whare pukapuka. Mēnā ka pai tā rāua kimi i te nuinga o ngā ISBN kei reira, ka tino nui te hononga o ō rāua porowhita, ka noho rānei tētahi hei huinga iti o tētahi atu. I whakaaro mātou, e hia ngā pukapuka ka taka <a <em>i waho rawa o ēnei porowhita</em>? Me nui ake te pātengi raraunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Ko te wā i aro mātou ki te pātengi raraunga pukapuka nui rawa atu i te ao: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. He pātengi raraunga motuhake tēnei nā te rōpū kore-pānga <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, e kohikohi ana i ngā rekoata metadata mai i ngā whare pukapuka puta noa i te ao, hei utu mō te tuku i aua whare pukapuka ki te uru atu ki te huinga raraunga katoa, me te whakaatu i a rātou i ngā hua rapu a ngā kaiwhakamahi mutunga."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Ahakoa he rōpū kore-pānga te OCLC, e hiahiatia ana e tā rātou tauira pakihi te tiaki i tā rātou pātengi raraunga. Āe rā, e pouri ana mātou ki te kī atu, e hoa mā i OCLC, kei te tuku mātou i ngā mea katoa. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "I te tau kua hipa, kua āta tāmiro mātou i ngā rekoata katoa o WorldCat. I te tuatahi, i whai wāimarie mātou. I te wā i whakarewahia ai e WorldCat tā rātou hoahoa paetukutuku hou katoa (i Akuhata 2022). I uru mai tēnei i te whakahoutanga nui o ō rātou pūnaha backend, me te whakauru mai i ngā hapa haumaru maha. I hopu wawe mātou i te whai wāhitanga, ā, i taea e mātou te tāmiro i ngā rekoata rau miriona (!) i roto i ngā rā torutoru noa iho."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>WorldCat redesign</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "I muri mai, i āta whakatikahia ngā hapa haumaru kotahi i te wā, tae noa ki te whakatikanga o te hapa whakamutunga i kitea e mātou i te marama kua hipa. I taua wā kua tata katoa ngā rekoata i a mātou, ā, i te whai noa mātou i ngā rekoata kounga teitei ake. Nā reira i whakaaro mātou kua tae te wā ki te tuku!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text10"
msgstr "Tirohia ētahi pārongo taketake mō ngā raraunga:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data.format"
msgstr "<strong>Hōputu?</strong> <a %(blog)s>Ngā Ipu o te Pūranga a Anna (AAC)</a>, he <a %(jsonlines)s>Rārangi JSON</a> kua kōpeke ki <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>, me ētahi tikanga paerewa. Ka takai ēnei ipu i ngā momo rekoata rerekē, i runga i ngā tāmiro rerekē i whakamahia e mātou."

